:"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-4","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#定义-30上下文中介迭代器-ℑ𝒜_σs-pp--s--k","content":"定义 30：上下文中介迭代器 `ℑ^𝒜_Σ(S, P)`，`P ⊆ S ⊆ K`","locale":"zh-CN"},"130":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-5","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#层次化组合","content":"层次化组合","locale":"zh-CN"},"131":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-6","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#观察等价332","content":"观察等价（§3.3.2）","locale":"zh-CN"},"132":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-7","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#独立性341","content":"独立性（§3.4.1）","locale":"zh-CN"},"133":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-8","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#余效应交换性342","content":"余效应交换性（§3.4.2）","locale":"zh-CN"},"134":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-9","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"驱动设计决策的例子","locale":"zh-CN"},"135":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-10","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#这种分解达成了什么","content":"这种分解达成了什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"136":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-11","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#工程要点","content":"工程要点","locale":"zh-CN"},"137":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-12","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","content":"本页概述论文（arXiv:2608.25512）的 §3.3–3.4。这一部分把*局部*保证（单个组件，见可撤销效应与响应式余效应）转化为*全局*保证（多个交错运行的组件，§4.3，见元理论）的前提。","locale":"zh-CN"},"138":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-13","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#定义-28上下文类型","content":"三个投影分别是当前状态（递归）、撤销本层效应（effect）的累加器，以及余效应（coeffect）上下文。`effect` 把 `𝔈Γ∞` 映射到自身，把 `∂` 塔折叠为一个自相似的类型。由于值类型族 `𝒱` 不受限制，**任何共享可变状态都可以编码为一个依赖**：`Σ` 涵盖所有共享状态，而不只是组件间的依赖。*组件与其环境之间的每一次交互都经过这一个实体。*","locale":"zh-CN"},"139":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-14","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#定义-29余效应--值类型操作","content":"键 `k` 上的余效应是一对 `(𝒱_k, 𝒜_k)`；每个参数为 `X_a`、结果为 `B_a` 的操作 `a ∈ 𝒜_k` **只作用于值本身**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"140":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-15","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#定义-29余效应--值类型操作","content":"也就是说，它是值上的一个效应函数再加一个结果。它在 `Σ` 上的提升（式 31）只读写键 `k` 上的绑定：类型把操作限制在它自己的键上。依赖于另一个键的操作必须把那个键的值读入自己的参数。操作诱导出一个等价关系 `≃_k`（§3.3.2，见下文）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"141":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-16","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#定义-30上下文中介迭代器-ℑ𝒜_σs-pp--s--k","content":"包含单位元、并对两种**阶段**形式封闭的最小迭代器集合：","locale":"zh-CN"},"142":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-17","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#定义-30上下文中介迭代器-ℑ𝒜_σs-pp--s--k","content":"**操作阶段**：对 `k ∈ S` 执行 `a ∈ 𝒜_k`，并根据结果选择延续；","locale":"zh-CN"},"143":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-18","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#定义-30上下文中介迭代器-ℑ𝒜_σs-pp--s--k","content":"**提供阶段**：对 `k ∈ P` 执行 `set(k, v)`（这是任何操作都无法创建的键）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"144":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-19","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#定义-30上下文中介迭代器-ℑ𝒜_σs-pp--s--k","content":"属于这一类，*正是*“通过上下文中介每一次交互”的形式含义。任何读取未被任何键绑定的位置的东西（例如一个从上下文未携带的计数器中分配句柄的分配器）都在这一类之外；一旦那个计数器被绑定到它自己的键上，它就变成被中介的了。","locale":"zh-CN"},"145":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-20","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#层次化组合","content":"递归结构形成一棵树：加载组件就是执行它的效应（插入）；卸载就是撤销这些效应而不影响其他组件；父组件汇总其所有子组件的效应，从而允许任意嵌套。","locale":"zh-CN"},"146":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-21","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#观察等价332","content":"定理 7 中的状态相等是一种理想化：`free` 不会恢复堆布局，新分配的名字也不会被“收回”。因此相等关系应**在观察等价 `≃` 的意义下**理解：当没有观察者能区分两个状态时，它们相关。上下文的观察者拿到的是它的余效应；值的观察者拿到的是其键上的操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"147":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-22","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#观察等价332","content":"**定义 31：测试 / 不可区分性。** `𝒜` 上的一个*测试*是由操作的正向映射与其产出的逆操作组成的有限字；当每个测试在两者上都有定义或都无定义、且产生相同结果时，记 `v ≈_𝒜 v′`。`≃_k := ≈_{𝒜_k}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"148":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-23","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#观察等价332","content":"**引理 32**：`≃_k` 是一个被 `𝒜_k` 中所有操作保持的等价关系，并且是此类关系中*最粗*的（证明原则：给出任意一个包含该对的、被保持的等价关系即可）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"149":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-24","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#观察等价332","content":"**定义 33**：在键集 `S` 上相关的状态在 `S` 上有相同的定义域，且在每个键上的值相关。`≃`（`S = K`）最细；`≃_S` 忽略 `S` 以外的键。相关的状态在满足性和 `notify_d` 上一致，因此*响应性是 `Σ/≃` 的性质*。","locale":"zh-CN"},"150":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-25","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#观察等价332","content":"**定义 34**：`≃` 在函数、积和 `Maybe` 上的逻辑关系扩展，对迭代器按余归纳理解。一个映射与自身相关时，称它*保持* `≃`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"151":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-26","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#观察等价332","content":"**引理 35**：在映射和迭代器上，`≃_S` 是部分等价关系。","locale":"zh-CN"},"152":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-27","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#观察等价332","content":"**定义 36/37**：*在 `≃_S` 意义下带见证*的效应函数和迭代器：用 `g(δ) ≃_S γ` 代替相等。","locale":"zh-CN"},"153":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-28","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#观察等价332","content":"**引理 38**：把 §3.1 中所有等式的 `=` 换成 `≃` 后依然成立。","locale":"zh-CN"},"154":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-29","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#观察等价332","content":"**引理 39**：上下文中介迭代器属于 `ℑ^S_Σ`，其中 `S` 是任意包含其各阶段所触及键的集合。","locale":"zh-CN"},"155":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-30","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#独立性341","content":"定理 16 没有覆盖两种情况，需要独立性：在*之后的*效应仍然存在时运行一个逆操作（从运行中的系统中移除一个组件），以及多个组件的效应交错进行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"156":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-31","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#独立性341","content":"**定义 40**：`reach(i)` 是通过延续可达的迭代器集合；变换幺半群 `𝔐(i)` 由 `reach(i)` 中所有正向映射与产出的逆操作生成；`len(i)` 是最长的延续链。","locale":"zh-CN"},"157":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-32","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#独立性341","content":"**引理 41**：交换性在生成元上即可判定；`⋄` 不会扩大该幺半群。","locale":"zh-CN"},"158":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-33","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#独立性341","content":"**定义 42：独立的迭代器** `i, j`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"159":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-34","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#独立性341","content":"一方的每个变换与另一方的每个变换可交换（对 `f ∈ 𝔐(i), g ∈ 𝔐(j)` 有 `f ∘ g = g ∘ f`）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"160":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-35","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#独立性341","content":"任何一方都不干扰另一方*产出*的东西（逆操作与延续）：`pr₂,₃(i′(g(γ))) = pr₂,₃(i′(γ))`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"161":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-36","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#独立性341","content":"**定理 43**：对两两独立的 `e₁…eₙ`，**以任意排列**应用它们产出的逆操作，都能到达 `γ₀`。无论顺序如何，每个逆操作都只撤回它自己的贡献。","locale":"zh-CN"},"162":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-37","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#余效应交换性342","content":"**定义 44**：当两个操作 `a, a′` 的提升是独立的效应函数，*并且*任何一方都不干扰另一方的结果时，称它们独立。当一个键上任意两个操作（包括操作与自身）都独立时，称该键是**可交换的**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"163":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-38","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#余效应交换性342","content":"**定理 45**：**不同键**上的操作总是独立的（键局部的映射可交换）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"164":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-39","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#余效应交换性342","content":"**定义 46：带见证的余效应**：余效应携带一个证明其键可交换的证据，作为第三个组成部分。与效应的见证一样，*这一义务落在提供该键的组件上*，而不是消费者。此后假定所有余效应都带见证。","locale":"zh-CN"},"165":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-40","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"键上的值","locale":"zh-CN"},"166":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-41","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"可交换？","locale":"zh-CN"},"167":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-42","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"168":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-43","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"每次注册都分配一个**新 id** 的条目表（路由、事件监听器）","locale":"zh-CN"},"169":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-44","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"**是**","locale":"zh-CN"},"170":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-45","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"两次注册对应两个条目；无论顺序如何，每个测试的回答都相同；任一条目都可在另一条目保留时被撤回。（与 CRDT 为每次添加打上唯一标签的原因相同。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"171":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-46","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"add/remove 只指明一个裸元素的集合","locale":"zh-CN"},"172":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-47","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"173":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-48","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"在两次 `add(x)` 之后移除 `x`，无法分辨要移除的是谁的 `x`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"174":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-49","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"有序的中间件链","locale":"zh-CN"},"175":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-50","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"**否**","locale":"zh-CN"},"176":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-51","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"插在另一个中间件之前的中间件看到的是不同的请求。顺序必须由外部施加（组件内部由累加器，组件之间由声明的余效应）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"177":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-52","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"句柄从不被比较的分配器","locale":"zh-CN"},"178":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-53","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"是（在重命名意义下）","locale":"zh-CN"},"179":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-54","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"`≃_k` 在句柄重命名的意义下关联堆（参见 CompCert）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"180":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-55","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"POSIX `open`（最小的空闲 fd）","locale":"zh-CN"},"181":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-56","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"182":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-57","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"下一次分配的结果可以区分两种顺序。`mmap`/`creat` 则没有问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"183":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-58","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"*接口设计规则（来自定义 31）*：公开更少的结果会使 `≃_k` 更粗；隐藏调用者不需要的结果可以使一个键变得可交换（参见可扩展交换性规则（scalable commutativity rule））。","locale":"zh-CN"},"184":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-59","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#驱动设计决策的例子","content":"**定理 47**：两个上下文中介迭代器，若满足 `P₁ ∩ S₂ = P₂ ∩ S₁ = ∅`（任何一方都不提供另一方触及的键），且共享的键都可交换，则它们独立。当所有余效应都带见证时，只剩这一不相交条件需要检查，而 §4（演算）从声明中直接读出它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"185":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-60","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#这种分解达成了什么","content":"计算中的**可交换部分**由效应承载：可以按任意顺序执行，也可以按任意顺序撤销（定理 43）。**顺序敏感部分**由余效应承载：组件内部由累加器施加 LIFO 顺序；组件之间由声明的余效应施加“提供者先于消费者”。因此，可组合性是在组件粒度上，而不是在单个效应粒度上获得的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"186":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-61","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#这种分解达成了什么","content":"**局限**：把每个共享位置都绑定到一个键上是一种*纪律*，而不是该构造本身的性质。系统无法具体化为余效应的位置不在该定理的范围内（见讨论与相关工作中 §6.1 的系统边界）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"187":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-62","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#工程要点","content":"把每个共享注册表都设计成“**以新 id 插入，按 id 删除**”。这正是使键可交换、让组件能以任意顺序卸载的条件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"188":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-63","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#工程要点","content":"顺序敏感的结构（中间件链、优先级列表）要么只归单个组件所有，要么把顺序显式化（例如显式的优先级值），使可观察的结果不依赖于插入顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"189":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-64","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#工程要点","content":"不要让组件绕过上下文去访问共享状态；任何绕过上下文的访问都不在这些保证之内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"190":{"id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm-65","page_id":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm#工程要点","content":"**在 kardia 中**：`kardia_core::IdTable<T>` 就是这种注册表：`insert` 返回一个新的、永不复用的 id，`remove` 接收这个 id，条目保持插入顺序。服务作者应当在它之上构建自己的注册表（路由、监听器、命令）。见服务与 API 设计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"191":{"id":"/docs/concepts-implementation","page_id":"/docs/concepts-implementation","type":"page","content":"论文中的实现","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts-implementation","locale":"zh-CN"},"192":{"id":"/docs/concepts-implementation-0","page_id":"/docs/concepts-implementation","tags":[],