docs/concepts#术语表","content":"生命周期状态 `θ`","locale":"zh-CN"},"712":{"id":"/docs/concepts-99","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"`Inactive \\| Reloading(i,g,ω) \\| Active(g,ω) \\| Unloading(g,ω)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"713":{"id":"/docs/concepts-100","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"已提交视图 `ω`","locale":"zh-CN"},"714":{"id":"/docs/concepts-101","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"在提交时把声明的键映射到*提供该键的纤程的名字*的映射。","locale":"zh-CN"},"715":{"id":"/docs/concepts-102","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"目标视图","locale":"zh-CN"},"716":{"id":"/docs/concepts-103","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"`ω` 现在应当是什么（若已退役或依赖未满足则为 `⊥`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"717":{"id":"/docs/concepts-104","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"守卫（`relied_n`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"718":{"id":"/docs/concepts-105","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"只有当没有任何已安装纤程的已提交视图指向 `n` 时，L-Unload 才能触发。","locale":"zh-CN"},"719":{"id":"/docs/concepts-106","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"静止（quiescent）","locale":"zh-CN"},"720":{"id":"/docs/concepts-107","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"每个纤程都在其目标处稳定下来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"721":{"id":"/docs/concepts-108","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"支撑集 `A`","locale":"zh-CN"},"722":{"id":"/docs/concepts-109","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"未退役、父纤程受支撑、且其声明的键都由受支撑纤程提供的那些纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"723":{"id":"/docs/concepts-110","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"惯性（inertia）","locale":"zh-CN"},"724":{"id":"/docs/concepts-111","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"异步宿主无法中止正在进行的迭代；只有 L-Divert 的*落地*选项可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"725":{"id":"/docs/concepts-112","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"系统边界","locale":"zh-CN"},"726":{"id":"/docs/concepts-113","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"系统能够独占地修改并恢复的位置在内部；其他位置在外部（外发会跨越边界）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"727":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","type":"page","content":"并发与执行模型","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-concurrency","locale":"zh-CN"},"728":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-0","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency","content":"kardia 如何用每个根一把锁、返回动作的临界区以及派生的转换任务，重现 JavaScript 的运行至完成原子性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"729":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-1","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-concurrency#why","content":"为什么这个模型很重要","locale":"zh-CN"},"730":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-2","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-concurrency#model","content":"选定的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"731":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-3","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-concurrency#lock-ordering","content":"加锁顺序","locale":"zh-CN"},"732":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-4","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency","content":"本页是指导决策中的决策 **D1**：一个 `Send + Sync` 的核心，每个根一把状态锁，持锁期间不运行任何用户代码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"733":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-5","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency#why","content":"Cordis 的正确性建立在 JavaScript 的运行至完成（run-to-completion）语义之上：两个 `await` 之间的代码是原子的。许多算法（`_setEpoch` 中的惯性（inertia）、加载器中的 `_initTask ??=`、“先同步赋值选项，再提交”）都依赖于这一点。Rust 移植必须重现*这种原子性*，而不是 JS 的单线程本身。","locale":"zh-CN"},"734":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-6","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency#model","content":"一个根的全部可变运行时状态都存放在 `Root { state: parking_lot::Mutex<State>, … }` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"735":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-7","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency#model","content":"**移植规则：** TS 代码中的每个同步段都变成 `State` 上的**一个临界区**。持锁期间不做任何等待，并且**持锁期间不调用任何用户代码**（插件的 `apply`、撤销函数（disposer）、事件监听器、可用性检查）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"736":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-8","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency#model","content":"临界区写成函数 `fn step(&mut State, …) -> Actions`，其中 `Actions` 是一个由延迟工作组成的小列表：`Spawn(Transition)`、`Emit(InternalEvent)`、`Wake(Notify)`、`RunDisposers(Vec<Disposer>)`。一个很小的驱动器在释放锁之后执行这些动作。这使状态机保持**纯粹且可单元测试**，并消除了 JS 所掩盖的重入隐患（在 TS 中，`_updateState` 会在状态机内部同步地向用户监听器发出 `internal/status`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"737":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-9","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency#model","content":"转换（`reload`、`unload`）是派生出的 tokio 任务。论文的脚注 2 预见到了这一点：*“在惰性调度下（例如 … Rust future），宿主必须派生任务，它才能推进。”*","locale":"zh-CN"},"738":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-10","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency#model","content":"句柄（`Context`、`Fiber`、`Svc<S>`）是 `Send + Sync` 的；插件的 future 必须是 `Send`。用户可以在插件内自由地 `tokio::spawn`（并把 `JoinHandle` 绑定到一个效应（effect）上）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"739":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-11","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency#model","content":"测试运行在带 `tokio::time::pause()` 的 `current_thread` 运行时上，以获得确定的交错执行（相当于 vitest 的假定时器）；生产环境可以使用多线程运行时。测试说明了如今每个测试套件使用哪种运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"740":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-12","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency#model","content":"在 `kardia-core`（`root.rs`）中，根是私有的 `RootInner { state: Mutex<State>, changed: Notify, logger: Mutex<LoggerState> }`。临界区是 `RootInner::run(|st: &mut State| …)`：它把 `Action` 推入 `State::actions`，而不是返回它们。动作包括 `Reload(FiberId)` 和 `Unload(FiberId)`（派生转换任务）、`Emit(..)`（把事件投递给监听器）、`Log { .. }`（通过日志器报告错误）以及 `Drop(..)`（在锁内释放的值在解锁后才丢弃，因为它们的析构函数是用户代码）。每个临界区在解锁后都会唤醒根级 `changed` 通知器上的所有等待者，而不是按动作执行 `Wake(Notify)`。撤销函数不作为动作运行：卸载转换会在锁外自行运行它们（见生命周期算法）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"741":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-13","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency#model","content":"**考虑过的替代方案：** 一种 `!Send` 的设计（在 `LocalSet` 上使用 `Rc<RefCell<..>>`）最贴近 JS 的字面形态，有一轮分析曾针对加载器推荐过它。它在核心中被否决，因为它会迫使生态中的每个插件和服务都兼容 `!Send`（不能 `tokio::spawn`，与大多数异步库配合起来很别扭），而上面的“锁加动作”约束能以相当的复杂度保持同样的原子性。如果之后的性能分析显示访问热路径上存在锁竞争，可以通过 `arc-swap` 发布已提交视图（committed view，在每个生命周期片段（episode）内不可变），而不改变语义。","locale":"zh-CN"},"742":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-14","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency#lock-ordering","content":"`core::State` 是最内层的锁。更高的层（`loader` 的树状态、`include` 的 IO 状态）有各自的互斥锁，它们只能在**释放**自己的锁**之后**调用 core，或者在持有自己的锁时调用，但**前提是 core 在持有其锁时从不回调它们**（D1 保证了这一点）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"743":{"id":"/docs/development-concurrency-15","page_id":"/docs/development-concurrency","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-concurrency#lock-ordering","content":"经验法则：*同一时间至多持有一把锁*。","locale":"zh-CN"},"744":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"page","content":"参与开发","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing","locale":"zh-CN"},"745":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-0","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing","content":"如何参与 kardia 的开发：构建与测试、xtask 命令、CI、发布到 crates.io 与 npm，以及文档站点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"746":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-1","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing#building","content":"构建与测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"747":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-2","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing#js","content":"npm 包","locale":"zh-CN"},"748":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-3","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"仓库任务：`cargo xtask`","locale":"zh-CN"},"749":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-4","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"CI","locale":"zh-CN"},"750":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-5","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing#releases","content":"发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"751":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-6","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-releases","content":"npm 发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"752":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-7","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-setup","content":"一次性设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"753":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-8","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"密钥、变量与凭据","locale":"zh-CN"},"754":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-9","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing#site","content":"文档站点","locale":"zh-CN"},"755":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-10","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing#content","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"756":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-11","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-contributing#deployment","content":"部署","locale":"zh-CN"},"757":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-12","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing","content":"kardia 在 github.com/licyk/kardia 上开发。本页介绍 Rust 工作区、`js/` 下的 npm 包、它们的 CI 与发布，以及本文档站点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"758":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-13","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing","content":"仓库的 `AGENTS.md` 列出了代码规则。简而言之：允许破坏性重构，不加兼容层；外部数据只在边界处校验一次，并容忍未知字段；未经事先同意，不为推测性的竞态或边界情况增加复杂度；主函数只保留正常流程，细节放在其下方的小型辅助函数中；只为不明显的约束写注释；生成的文件应重新生成而不是手动编辑；测试真实的实现，尽量少用 mock；遵循仓库现有的工具和工作流；只有当函数会被复用、逻辑复杂或代表一个可以命名的概念时才提取它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"759":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-14","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#building","content":"WASM 访客插件测试会把它的测试夹具构建为 WebAssembly 模块，因此请先安装该目标：`rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"760":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-15","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#building","content":"有些测试会在运行时用 cargo 构建夹具 crate，因此第一次运行会稍慢一些。","locale":"zh-CN"},"761":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-16","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#building","content":"这些 crate 的最低支持 Rust 版本是 1.85（工作区 `Cargo.toml` 中的 `rust-version`）；CI 使用一个固定的、更新的工具链（见下文）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"762":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-17","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#building","content":"测试如何组织，以及每个测试套件使用哪个运行时，见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"763":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-18","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#js","content":"`js/` 是 `@kardiajs/*` 包的 Bun 工作区（TypeScript 与 Tauri），位于 Cargo 工作区之外：","locale":"zh-CN"},"764":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-19","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#js","content":"各包之间按名称导入。类型检查和测试把这些名称解析到源码（`tsconfig.json` 的 paths、`vitest.config.ts` 的 alias），因此无需先构建；构建时则解析到已构建的包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"765":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-20","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#js","content":"包内的模块以绝对路径互相导入：`import { Fiber } from \"#/fiber\"`。`#/` 是子路径导入（subpath import），在每个 `package.json` 中映射（`\"imports\": { \"#/*\": { \"source\": \"./src/*.ts\", \"types\": \"./lib/*.d.ts\", \"default\": \"./lib/*.js\" } }`）。Node、TypeScript 和打包工具都按包解析它，因此发布的 `lib/` 可以直接使用 `tsc` 的输出；类型检查和测试通过 `source` 条件把它解析到源码（`tsconfig.json` 中的 `customConditions`、`vitest.config.ts` 中的 `ssr.resolve.conditions`）。`site/` 使用的 `@/` 别名无法保留到已发布的包中，因为 `tsc` 不会改写路径别名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"766":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-21","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#js","content":"构建会把仓库的 `LICENSE` 和 `js/NOTICE`（Cordis 的 MIT 声明）复制进每个包，因为 npm 只发布包目录内的文件；这些副本已被 gitignore。","locale":"zh-CN"},"767":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-22","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#js","content":"各包以 peer 依赖互相引用（`\"@kardiajs/core\": \"^0.1\"`），因此应用中只有一份运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"768":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-23","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"`xtask` crate（`xtask/`，工作区成员，从不发布）承载仓库自身的任务；`.cargo/config.toml` 让它们以 `cargo xtask <命令>` 运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"769":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-24","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"770":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-25","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"771":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-26","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"`cargo xtask arch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"772":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-27","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"检查模块结构：每个 `lib.rs` 和 `mod.rs`（位于 `crates/*/src`、`crates/*/tests` 和 `xtask/src`）只声明模块、重新导出，并承载文档和属性。实现代码（函数、类型、trait、`impl` 块、常量、静态变量、`macro_rules!`、内联测试模块）放在各自的文件里，再由入口文件重新导出。只做重新导出的内联模块（如 `kardia::prelude`）以及 Rust 要求放在 crate 根部的过程宏入口函数是允许的。它会列出每处违规的文件、行号和种类，只要有违规就失败。CI 会运行它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"773":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-28","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"`cargo xtask version <patch\\|minor\\|major> [--dry-run]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"774":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-29","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"递增工作区版本（`0.1.3` → `0.1.4` / `0.2.0` / `1.0.0`），更新 `[workspace.package]`、`[workspace.dependencies]` 中的 `kardia-*` 条目以及 `Cargo.lock`。当用户填写的版本要求发生变化时（1.0 之前的 minor 或 major 递增、1.0 之后的 major 递增），还会更新 README 和本文档中的 `kardia = \"0.x\"` 依赖片段。它不会提交。","locale":"zh-CN"},"775":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-30","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"`cargo xtask tag [--version X.Y.Z \\| --name NAME] [--message TEXT] [--push] [--remote NAME] [--dry-run]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"776":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-31","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"在 `HEAD` 上创建一个附注标签：默认是 `v<工作区版本>`。`--version` 必须等于工作区版本（`v*` 标签会发布它），`--name` 用来创建其他任意标签。工作区有未提交的修改，或标签已经存在（在本地，或使用 `--push` 时在远端）时，它会拒绝执行。`--push` 会推送标签（到 `origin`，或 `--remote` 指定的远端）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"777":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-32","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"`cargo xtask js-version <patch\\|minor\\|major> [--dry-run]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"778":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-33","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"递增 npm 包的版本，这些包共用一个独立的版本：更新每个 `js/packages/*/package.json` 中的 `version`，在版本要求变化时更新它们互相引用的 `^` 范围，并更新 `js/bun.lock`（`bun install`）。各包版本不一致时它会拒绝执行。它不会提交。","locale":"zh-CN"},"779":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-34","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"`cargo xtask js-tag [与 tag 相同的选项]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"780":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-35","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#xtask","content":"与 `tag` 相同，用于 npm 包：默认是 `js-v<版本>`，它会启动 npm 发布。","locale":"zh-CN"},"781":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-36","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"仓库有五个工作流，各管一部分，使每次修改只运行它所需要的检查，而一次发布只对提交测试一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"782":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-37","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"工作流","locale":"zh-CN"},"783":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-38","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"触发条件","locale":"zh-CN"},"784":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-39","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"785":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-40","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`ci.yml`（Rust）","locale":"zh-CN"},"786":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-41","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"推送到 `main` 和拉取请求，但只修改 `site/`、`js/`、Markdown、`LICENSE`、`NOTICE` 和托管配置文件的除外；手动运行；被 Release 调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"787":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-42","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"fmt、clippy、`cargo xtask arch`、测试套件","locale":"zh-CN"},"788":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-43","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`js.yml`（npm 包）","locale":"zh-CN"},"789":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-44","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"修改了 `js/` 或 `crates/kardia-bridge/` 的推送到 `main` 和拉取请求；手动运行；被 npm release 调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"790":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-45","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"各包的类型检查、测试和构建；桥对 Rust 宿主的端到端测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"791":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-46","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`site.yml`（文档）","locale":"zh-CN"},"792":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-47","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"修改了 `site/` 的推送到 `main` 和拉取请求；手动运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"793":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-48","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"站点的类型检查、测试和构建；在拉取请求之外还会部署（见下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"794":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-49","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`release.yml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"795":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-50","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`v*` 标签；手动运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"796":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-51","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"发布到 crates.io（见下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"797":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-52","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`npm-release.yml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"798":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-53","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`js-v*` 标签（`v*` 不匹配它）；手动运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"799":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-54","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"发布到 npm（见下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"800":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-55","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"CI 的步骤：","locale":"zh-CN"},"801":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-56","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"检出仓库。","locale":"zh-CN"},"802":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-57","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"安装 Rust **1.99.1**（`dtolnay/rust-toolchain@1.99.1`），以及 `rustfmt`、`clippy` 和 `wasm32-unknown-unknown` 目标。工具链之所以固定版本，是因为 `kardia-macros` 的编译错误快照（trybuild 测试）依赖于编译器版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"803":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-58","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"恢复 cargo 缓存（`Swatinem/rust-cache`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"804":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-59","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`cargo fmt --all --check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"805":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-60","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`","locale":"zh-CN"},"806":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-61","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`cargo xtask arch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"807":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-62","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`cargo test --workspace`","locale":"zh-CN"},"808":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-63","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"同一分支或拉取请求的较新推送会取消较早的 CI 运行。标签从不触发 CI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"809":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-64","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"修改的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"810":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-65","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"811":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-66","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"文档页面（`site/`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"812":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-67","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"只有 `site.yml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"813":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-68","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"README、`AGENTS.md`、许可证","locale":"zh-CN"},"814":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-69","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"什么都不运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"815":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-70","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"Rust 代码、测试、`Cargo.*`、`xtask/`、除 `site.yml` 和 js 相关工作流以外的工作流","locale":"zh-CN"},"816":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-71","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`ci.yml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"817":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-72","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`js/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"818":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-73","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"只有 `js.yml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"819":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-74","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`crates/kardia-bridge/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"820":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-75","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`ci.yml` 和 `js.yml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"821":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-76","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"版本递增，然后打标签","locale":"zh-CN"},"822":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-77","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"`ci.yml` 运行一次；`release.yml` 复用那次运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"823":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-78","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"npm 版本递增，然后打 `js-v*` 标签","locale":"zh-CN"},"824":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-79","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#ci","content":"推送时运行 `js.yml`，作为发布的检查时再运行一次","locale":"zh-CN"},"825":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-80","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#releases","content":"所有 crate 共用一个版本，即根目录 `Cargo.toml` 中 `[workspace.package]` 下的 `version`（kardia 各 crate 在 `[workspace.dependencies]` 中的条目也带有这个版本）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"826":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-81","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#releases","content":"运行 `cargo xtask version patch`（或 `minor`、`major`），然后提交并推送：`git commit -am \"chore(release): kardia 0.1.1\"`、`git push`。这次推送会运行 CI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"827":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-82","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#releases","content":"`cargo xtask tag --push` 把该提交标记为 `v0.1.1` 并推送标签，从而启动 `.github/workflows/release.yml`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"828":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-83","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#releases","content":"Release 先检查标签是否对应工作区版本，然后找到 CI 对这个提交的运行，如果它还在进行就等待：通过的运行被直接复用，失败的运行会终止发布。只有在没有可用运行时（CI 从未运行过的提交，或被较新推送取消的运行），Release 才会自己调用 `ci.yml` 作为检查。每个被发布的提交只测试一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"829":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-84","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#releases","content":"它按依赖顺序发布每个新版本尚未出现在 crates.io 上的 crate（`cargo publish --workspace`；`xtask` 从不发布），然后为该标签创建一个 GitHub release，说明从上一个 `v*` 标签开始生成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"830":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-85","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#releases","content":"发布步骤是**可续跑的**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"831":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-86","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#releases","content":"每次尝试之前，它会向 crates.io API 查询哪些 `name@version` 组合已经存在，并排除这些 crate，因此一个 crate 不会被发布两次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"832":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-87","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#releases","content":"crates.io 只允许一个账户一次创建少量新 crate，之后每十分钟一个。当 `cargo publish` 因 `429 Too Many Requests` 失败时，工作流等待 610 秒后重试，最多尝试八次；其他任何失败都会使该步骤失败。新增 crate 的发布会等过这个限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"833":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-88","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#releases","content":"也可以在某个分支上手动启动这个工作流（`workflow_dispatch`），续跑一次中途停下的发布。","locale":"zh-CN"},"834":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-89","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#releases","content":"它使用仓库密钥 `CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN` 发布。","locale":"zh-CN"},"835":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-90","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-releases","content":"`@kardiajs/*` 各包共用一个版本，与 crate 的版本分开（从 0.1.0 开始）。桥的协议有自己的版本（两侧的 `PROTOCOL`）：以其他版本打开会话的客户端会被以 `invalid` 错误拒绝，因此来自不同发布的宿主和客户端会明确失败，而不是行为异常。","locale":"zh-CN"},"836":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-91","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-releases","content":"`cargo xtask js-version patch`（或 `minor`、`major`），然后提交并推送：`git commit -am \"chore(release): @kardiajs 0.1.1\"`、`git push`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"837":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-92","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-releases","content":"`cargo xtask js-tag --push` 把该提交标记为 `js-v0.1.1` 并推送标签，从而启动 `.github/workflows/npm-release.yml`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"838":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-93","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-releases","content":"该工作流检查每个包都处于所标记的版本，以 `js.yml` 作为检查，构建各包，并按 core、timer、bridge、tauri、vue 的顺序发布，跳过 npm 上已有的版本（因此手动运行可以续跑一次中途停下的发布）。随后它为该标签创建 GitHub release，说明从上一个 `js-v*` 标签开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"839":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-94","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-releases","content":"它使用 **npm 可信发布**（trusted publishing）：发布任务的 `id-token: write` 权限让它可以签发一个短期 OIDC 令牌，npm 对那些可信发布者指向本仓库和本工作流的包接受该令牌。任何地方都不保存 npm 令牌，npm 还会自动为每个版本附上来源证明（provenance，这要求仓库保持公开）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"840":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-95","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-setup","content":"**npmjs.com，组织。** 创建免费组织 `kardiajs`（`kardia` 包名和 `@kardia` 作用域属于他人），并加入维护者的账户。为这些账户启用双因素认证。","locale":"zh-CN"},"841":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-96","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-setup","content":"**npmjs.com，首次发布。** npm 在包的设置中配置可信发布者，因此每个包必须先存在。在用 `npm login` 登录的机器上：`cd js && bun install && bun run build`，然后按顺序在 `packages/core`、`timer`、`bridge`、`tauri` 和 `vue` 中执行 `npm publish --access public`。这样发布的首个版本不带来源证明；之后的版本都由 CI 发布。之后新增的包（如 `@kardiajs/vue`）在首次 CI 发布之前，同样需要这一步和它自己的可信发布者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"842":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-97","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-setup","content":"**GitHub，环境。** 在仓库的 *Settings → Environments* 中创建 `npm`。可以选择把它的部署限制为 `js-v*` 标签，并添加必需的审核人：发布任务会等待他们批准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"843":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-98","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-setup","content":"**npmjs.com，可信发布者。** 在每个包的 *Settings → Trusted publishing* 中添加一个 GitHub Actions 发布者：组织或用户 `licyk`，仓库 `kardia`，工作流 `npm-release.yml`，环境 `npm`。这些字段区分大小写，npm 只在发布时检查它们。新建的可信发布者必须在两天内完成一次发布，否则会过期并需要重新创建，因此请紧接着发布一个版本（第 5 步）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"844":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-99","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#npm-setup","content":"**首次 CI 发布。** 按上文递增版本并打标签。发布完成后，把每个包的 *Publishing access* 设为 \"Require two-factor authentication and disallow tokens\"，这样只有可信发布者（以及启用了双因素认证的维护者）可以发布。","locale":"zh-CN"},"845":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-100","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"846":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-101","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"847":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-102","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"使用者","locale":"zh-CN"},"848":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-103","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"849":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-104","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"GitHub，仓库密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"850":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-105","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"`CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN`","locale":"zh-CN"},"851":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-106","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"`release.yml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"852":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-107","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"带发布权限的 crates.io API 令牌；已存在","locale":"zh-CN"},"853":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-108","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"GitHub，仓库密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"854":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-109","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"`GITEE_RSA_PRIVATE_KEY`","locale":"zh-CN"},"855":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-110","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"`site.yml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"856":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-111","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"把站点推送到 `gh-pages` 的部署密钥；已存在","locale":"zh-CN"},"857":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-112","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"GitHub，环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"858":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-113","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"`npm`","locale":"zh-CN"},"859":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-114","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"`npm-release.yml`（发布任务）","locale":"zh-CN"},"860":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-115","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"不保存密钥：它是可信发布者所指定的环境，并承载保护规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"861":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-116","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"GitHub，仓库变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"862":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-117","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"863":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-118","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"GitHub，工作流令牌","locale":"zh-CN"},"864":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-119","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"`GITHUB_TOKEN`","locale":"zh-CN"},"865":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-120","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"各发布任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"866":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-121","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"由 Actions 提供；各任务只在需要处申请 `contents: write`（GitHub release）和 `id-token: write`（npm）","locale":"zh-CN"},"867":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-122","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"npmjs.com","locale":"zh-CN"},"868":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-123","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"组织 `kardiajs`、每个包一个可信发布者、\"要求双因素认证并禁止令牌\"策略","locale":"zh-CN"},"869":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-124","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"npm","locale":"zh-CN"},"870":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-125","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"在 npmjs.com 上配置，而不是在 GitHub 中","locale":"zh-CN"},"871":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-126","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#credentials","content":"不存在 `NPM_TOKEN`。如果将来必须绕过可信发布，可以退而使用一个仅限 `@kardiajs` 各包的细粒度 npm 访问令牌，保存为 `npm` 环境的密钥；本工作流不使用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"872":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-127","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#site","content":"本站点位于 `site/`：基于 TanStack Start（React）的 Fumadocs，用 Vite 和 Tailwind CSS 构建，以 Bun 作为包管理器和脚本运行器。它位于 Cargo 工作区之外，因此不影响 `cargo` 命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"873":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-128","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#site","content":"`bun.lock` 已提交到仓库；`bun install --frozen-lockfile` 会严格安装锁定的版本，部署工作流就是这样做的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"874":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-129","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#content","content":"页面是 `site/content/docs/` 中的 MDX 文件，使用按前缀分组的扁平 slug（`guide-*`、`concepts-*`、`reference-*`、`development-*`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"875":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-130","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#content","content":"站点是双语的。中文是默认语言：`<slug>.mdx`，不带前缀提供。英文是 `<slug>.en.mdx`，在 `/en/` 下提供。每个页面都有两种语言的版本，并有一个测试检查这一点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"876":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-131","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#content","content":"侧边栏的顺序及其分节标题来自 `meta.json`（中文）和 `meta.en.json`（英文）。两者必须以相同的顺序列出相同的 slug；同样有一个测试检查这一点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"877":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-132","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#content","content":"页面之间的链接使用 `/docs/<slug>`（站点会自行加上 `/en`）。除 Fumadocs 的默认组件外，页面无需导入即可使用 `Cards`、`Callout`、`Steps`、`Tabs`、`Accordions` 和 `Mermaid` 组件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"878":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-133","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#content","content":"代码、标识符、配置示例和论文的记号在两种语言中都保持原样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"879":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-134","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#deployment","content":"`.github/workflows/site.yml` 负责检查和部署站点；只修改文档时不会运行 Rust 的检查。涉及 `site/` 的拉取请求会执行类型检查、测试和构建。涉及 `site/` 的推送到 `main` 还会以 `VITE_BASE_PATH=/kardia/` 构建站点，并把输出发布到 `gh-pages` 分支（使用部署密钥 `GITEE_RSA_PRIVATE_KEY`），由 GitHub Pages 在 **https\\://licyk.github.io/kardia/** 提供服务。部署每次只运行一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"880":{"id":"/docs/development-contributing-135","page_id":"/docs/development-contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-contributing#deployment","content":"基础路径仅用于 GitHub Pages，因为它在 `/kardia/` 下提供站点；不设置 `VITE_BASE_PATH` 时，构建产物从 `/` 提供服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"881":{"id":"/docs/development-design","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"page","content":"API 设计","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design","locale":"zh-CN"},"882":{"id":"/docs/development-design-0","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design","content":"kardia 的 API 设计：服务、键与受检访问、调用者归属、效应与中断、插件与配置、生命周期状态机、事件、日志器以及内置插件 crate。","locale":"zh-CN"},"883":{"id":"/docs/development-design-1","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#services","content":"服务、键与访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"884":{"id":"/docs/development-design-2","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#service-trait","content":"`Service` trait","locale":"zh-CN"},"885":{"id":"/docs/development-design-3","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#providing","content":"提供","locale":"zh-CN"},"886":{"id":"/docs/development-design-4","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#accessing","content":"访问（算法 6）","locale":"zh-CN"},"887":{"id":"/docs/development-design-5","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#caller-attribution","content":"调用者归属（D4）","locale":"zh-CN"},"888":{"id":"/docs/development-design-6","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#mixins","content":"关联属性与 mixin","locale":"zh-CN"},"889":{"id":"/docs/development-design-7","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#effects","content":"效应（D5、D6）","locale":"zh-CN"},"890":{"id":"/docs/development-design-8","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#effects-api","content":"API","locale":"zh-CN"},"891":{"id":"/docs/development-design-9","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#effects-semantics","content":"语义（来自 `fiber.ts:292-357`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"892":{"id":"/docs/development-design-10","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#interruption","content":"中断与取消安全（D6）","locale":"zh-CN"},"893":{"id":"/docs/development-design-11","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#plugins","content":"插件、配置与生命周期","locale":"zh-CN"},"894":{"id":"/docs/development-design-12","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#plugin-trait","content":"Plugin trait","locale":"zh-CN"},"895":{"id":"/docs/development-design-13","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#configuration","content":"配置（D7）","locale":"zh-CN"},"896":{"id":"/docs/development-design-14","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#lifecycle","content":"生命周期状态机（`lifecycle.rs`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"897":{"id":"/docs/development-design-15","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#instantiation","content":"实例化（O-Insert / O-Retire）","locale":"zh-CN"},"898":{"id":"/docs/development-design-16","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#replace","content":"注册表替换","locale":"zh-CN"},"899":{"id":"/docs/development-design-17","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#fiber-handle","content":"`Fiber` 句柄 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"900":{"id":"/docs/development-design-18","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#events","content":"事件、日志器与内置服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"901":{"id":"/docs/development-design-19","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#typed-events","content":"带类型的事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"902":{"id":"/docs/development-design-20","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#logger","content":"日志器","locale":"zh-CN"},"903":{"id":"/docs/development-design-21","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"内置插件 crate","locale":"zh-CN"},"904":{"id":"/docs/development-design-22","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design","content":"本页介绍 `kardia-core` 与内置插件 crate 的公开 API：服务与访问（决策 D3、D4）、效应（effect）（D5、D6）、插件、配置与生命周期（D7），以及事件、日志器与内置服务。这些 API 所操作的数据结构见核心数据结构。面向用户的介绍见指南页面插件、服务和效应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"905":{"id":"/docs/development-design-23","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design","content":"下面的签名是计划中的设计。其中大多数在代码中以相同的名称存在；凡是名称、参数或返回类型有变化之处，草图下方的说明给出了当前的 API。有意为之的行为偏离列在状态与偏离中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"906":{"id":"/docs/development-design-24","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#service-trait","content":"（关联类型默认值尚未稳定；实现会把 `Meta` 放到单独的 `trait Intercepted: Service` 上，并提供一个“无元数据”的通用默认实现。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"907":{"id":"/docs/development-design-25","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#service-trait","content":"代码中既没有 `Meta` 类型，也没有 `Mergeable` / `Intercepted`。拦截元数据保持为 JSON：`trait Service: Any + Send + Sync { const NAME: &'static str; fn merge_intercept(values: Vec<Value>) -> Value { merge_shallow(values) } }`，其中各值按从最外层到内层的顺序给出，默认实现是对 JSON 对象做右偏的浅合并。服务通过 `ctx.intercept_meta::<T>(key)` 读取带类型的元数据。`#[derive(Service)]`（来自 `kardia-macros`）实现该 trait；`#[service(name = \"database\")]` 设置键，默认是以连字符连接的类型名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"908":{"id":"/docs/development-design-26","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#providing","content":"语义与 `ReflectService.provide` 完全一致：","locale":"zh-CN"},"909":{"id":"/docs/development-design-27","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#providing","content":"是一个受跟踪的效应；","locale":"zh-CN"},"910":{"id":"/docs/development-design-28","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#providing","content":"每个领域（realm）只有单一来源（`AlreadyProvided { key, by }`）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"911":{"id":"/docs/development-design-29","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#providing","content":"只有当提供服务的纤程（fiber）处于 `Active` 时才立即通知，否则在它转换到 `Active` 时通知；","locale":"zh-CN"},"912":{"id":"/docs/development-design-30","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#providing","content":"逆操作移除绑定、通知该领域、**等待 `dependents` 变为空**，然后移除该提供。","locale":"zh-CN"},"913":{"id":"/docs/development-design-31","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#providing","content":"原地覆盖（`reflect.set`）以 `ctx.replace_value::<S>(..)` 的形式提供，并且与 Cordis 和论文中一样，依赖者*不会*观察到它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"914":{"id":"/docs/development-design-32","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#providing","content":"在代码中，`provide` 与 `provide_arc` 返回 `kardia_core::Result<EffectHandle>`（错误类型是 `kardia_core::Error`，它包装了 `KardiaError::AlreadyProvided` 及其他变体）。其他变体：`provide_as` / `provide_arc_as`（以显式的键提供任意值）、`provide_checked`（带可用性谓词）以及 `provide_serialized_as`（附带供表达式和工具使用的 JSON 视图的值）。`ctx.replace_value` 没有实现：`KardiaError::NotProvided` 和 `ForeignBinding` 是为它声明的，但没有任何 API 返回它们。退役一个提供者会立即解除其仍然有效的提供的绑定（见已退役的提供者）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"915":{"id":"/docs/development-design-33","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#accessing","content":"`get` 实现了 `locate`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"916":{"id":"/docs/development-design-34","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#accessing","content":"同一领域中自己的提供；","locale":"zh-CN"},"917":{"id":"/docs/development-design-35","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#accessing","content":"沿纤程向上查找；","locale":"zh-CN"},"918":{"id":"/docs/development-design-36","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#accessing","content":"在隔离边界处停止；","locale":"zh-CN"},"919":{"id":"/docs/development-design-37","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#accessing","content":"第一个其 `committed` 中含有该键的纤程返回它；","locale":"zh-CN"},"920":{"id":"/docs/development-design-38","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#accessing","content":"声明了该键但没有已提交实现的纤程 → `Inactive`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"921":{"id":"/docs/development-design-39","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#accessing","content":"到达根 → 根对实时存储拥有**不受检**的访问（与 Cordis 中一样）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"922":{"id":"/docs/development-design-40","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#accessing","content":"读取已提交视图（committed view）而不是存储，使得依赖在消费者自身拆除期间仍然可读（定理 70）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"923":{"id":"/docs/development-design-41","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#accessing","content":"带类型的声明：`Plugin::Inject` 可以是服务类型的元组（`(Database, Cache)`），通过对元组使用 `macro_rules!` 实现，同时产生运行时的 `InjectSpec` 和一个带类型的访问器 `ctx.deps::<P::Inject>() -> Result<(Svc<Database>, Svc<Cache>)>`。这是朝论文建议的编译期中介迈出的第一步，且不需要过程宏（§5.1.4、§6.4）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"924":{"id":"/docs/development-design-42","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#accessing","content":"在代码中：`get` 与 `AccessError` 与草图一致。`try_get_live` 是 `live::<S>()`（以及 `live_as::<T>(key)`）；`get_dyn` 是 `get_as::<T>(key)`（按名称取带类型的值），以及 `view(key)`（取服务的 JSON 视图，加载器的表达式使用它）。带类型的声明使用 `Deps` trait（通过 `macro_rules!` 为至多八个服务的元组实现）：`Inject::of::<(Database, Cache)>()` 构建运行时声明，`ctx.deps::<(Database, Cache)>()` 返回 `(Svc<Database>, Svc<Cache>)`。`Plugin` 没有 `Inject` 关联类型；它通过 `fn inject() -> Inject` 声明。编译期的那一步是 `Injected<D>`，由 `#[plugin]` 使用（见受检的带类型访问）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"925":{"id":"/docs/development-design-43","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#caller-attribution","content":"*代表调用者*创建的效应使用 `svc.caller().effect(..)`：它们落在调用者的纤程中，这正是 Cordis 的 tracker 借助 `this.ctx` 所实现的效果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"926":{"id":"/docs/development-design-44","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#caller-attribution","content":"服务通过它在构造时保存的 `Context`（其定义处）解析*自己的*依赖，因此不需要 shadow 上下文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"927":{"id":"/docs/development-design-45","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#caller-attribution","content":"服务 crate 以 **`Svc<S>` 上的扩展 trait** 的形式暴露感知调用者的 API（由于该 trait 是本地的，一致性规则允许这样做）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"928":{"id":"/docs/development-design-46","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#caller-attribution","content":"拦截元数据在访问时按 Def. 27 / `resolveIntercept` 解析：`[declared inject meta, outer…, inner]` 做右偏合并。","locale":"zh-CN"},"929":{"id":"/docs/development-design-47","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#caller-attribution","content":"在代码中，`Svc<T>` 持有值 `Arc<T>`、调用者 `Context`、`key`、`impl_id` 以及提供服务的纤程，并提供 `caller()`、`key()`、`impl_id()`、`arc()`、`provider()` 和 `logger()`。`intercept()` 变成了 `meta() -> Value`（用 `S::merge_intercept` 合并）和 `intercepts() -> Vec<Value>`（未合并的列表，声明的 `inject` 元数据在最前）。定时器的 `TimerExt::timeout` 返回 `Result<EffectHandle>`，并注册 `self.caller().effect_sync(\"ctx.timeout()\", …)`。服务之间的调用遵循定义处，这与 TS 不同（见服务之间的调用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"930":{"id":"/docs/development-design-48","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#mixins","content":"Cordis 的 `foo.bar` 关联服务和 `ctx.mixin` 是针对 JS 对象的便利设施。在 Rust 中：名为 `foo.bar` 的服务只是另一个键；“扩展另一个插件的类型”通过扩展 trait（编译期）或基于 `IdTable` 构建的注册表服务（运行时）来完成。访问器 / mixin 层不移植。","locale":"zh-CN"},"931":{"id":"/docs/development-design-49","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-api","content":"在代码中（`effect.rs`、`fiber.rs`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"932":{"id":"/docs/development-design-50","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-api","content":"`Disposer` 是一个在运行时被消耗的结构体（`Disposer::new(FnOnce())`、`fallible(FnOnce() -> Result<()>)`、`future(..)`、`try_future(..)`）；它的闭包在释放开始时同步运行，并且可以返回一个完成剩余工作的 future。panic 会被捕获并作为错误报告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"933":{"id":"/docs/development-design-51","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-api","content":"标签是 `impl Into<String>`。`effect_sync` 接受 `FnOnce(&EffectScope) -> Result<()>`：函数体把它的逆操作收集到作用域上，而不是返回一个逆操作。`effect` 接受 `FnOnce(EffectScope) -> Fut`，其中 `Fut: Future<Output = Result<()>>`；函数体被派生为任务运行。两者都返回 `kardia_core::Result<EffectHandle>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"934":{"id":"/docs/development-design-52","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-api","content":"`on_dispose` 返回 `Result<EffectHandle>`；`ctx.defer(label, disposer)` 注册任意一个 `Disposer`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"935":{"id":"/docs/development-design-53","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-api","content":"`ctx.checkpoint()`、`scope.checkpoint()` 和 `scope.yield_(d)` 是同步的：`ctx.checkpoint()?`、`scope.yield_(d)?`。`EffectScope` 的方法接受 `&self`（作用域是 `Clone` 的），并且有一个简写 `defer_fn`；`adopt` 接受 `impl Into<EffectHandle>`（`Fiber` 可以转换过去）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"936":{"id":"/docs/development-design-54","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-api","content":"`EffectHandle::dispose()` 返回一个 `Disposal`，它是 `Result<()>` 的 future，也可以直接丢弃；`ready()` 返回 `Result<()>` 的 future。该句柄还有 `label()`、`is_active()` 和 `meta()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"937":{"id":"/docs/development-design-55","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-semantics","content":"`assert_active`：在已移除的纤程上创建效应会以 `KardiaError::InactiveEffect` 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"938":{"id":"/docs/development-design-56","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-semantics","content":"在一个效应内部：撤销函数（disposer）**按逆序依次**运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"939":{"id":"/docs/development-design-57","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-semantics","content":"所有权转移：在一个效应内部创建的嵌套 `EffectHandle` 注册在纤程上；`scope.adopt(h)` 把它移到外层效应之下（即 TS 中的 `collect` → `_disposables.delete`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"940":{"id":"/docs/development-design-58","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-semantics","content":"效应体失败时，会释放它已收集的内容；同步错误传播给调用者，异步错误则被记录到日志并通过 `ready()` 报告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"941":{"id":"/docs/development-design-59","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-semantics","content":"纤程卸载时按插入的逆序清空累积器，并**并发地**运行撤销函数（`join_all`），记录失败和 panic（`catch_unwind`），因为 Cordis 的测试要求兄弟效应并发地清理（`service-dispose.spec.ts`）。有序的拆除通过把各步骤归入同一个效应来获得。","locale":"zh-CN"},"942":{"id":"/docs/development-design-60","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#effects-semantics","content":"`EffectHandle` 是不持有所有权的句柄：丢弃它**不会**释放。组件的生命周期是动态的，由纤程管理，这恰恰是论文区分 Cordis 与 RAII 之处（§7.3：词法作用域是互补的，适用于单个效应内部的局部资源；在撤销函数内部，普通的 `Drop` 类型完全可以使用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"943":{"id":"/docs/development-design-61","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#interruption","content":"Rust *能够*通过丢弃 future 来取消它，这是 JS 做不到的，因此 Rust 宿主可以提供论文中*中止式*的 L-Divert。计划有意**不**丢弃正在执行的 `apply` future：一个在“获取资源”与“注册其撤销函数”之间被丢弃的 future，恰恰会泄漏时间可组合性所承诺回收的东西。取而代之的是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"944":{"id":"/docs/development-design-62","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#interruption","content":"宿主是**惯性的**（论文 §4.4）：一次过时的加载会完成，然后再卸载；","locale":"zh-CN"},"945":{"id":"/docs/development-design-63","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#interruption","content":"显式边界 `scope.yield_(..).await?` 和 `ctx.checkpoint().await?` 在纤程的目标自加载开始以来发生变化时返回 `Err(Interrupted)`（即 TS 中的 `while (runner.epoch === oldEpoch)` 检查）。从 `apply` 返回 `Interrupted` 并不是失败；纤程会卸载它已注册的内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"946":{"id":"/docs/development-design-64","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#interruption","content":"这是把加载器的外层纤程模式（导入之后的 `yield () => {}`）显式化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"947":{"id":"/docs/development-design-65","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#interruption","content":"在代码中这些边界是同步的（`scope.yield_(..)?`、`ctx.checkpoint()?`）。一旦加载已被取代（纤程的目标不再等于其生命周期片段（episode）的目标）或纤程已退役，`ctx.checkpoint()` 就会失败；一旦效应已被释放，`scope.checkpoint()` 就会失败。异步效应体被派生为任务运行，永远不会被中途丢弃；释放会等待效应体运行到结束或到达一个边界。","locale":"zh-CN"},"948":{"id":"/docs/development-design-66","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#plugin-trait","content":"存储在运行时中的类型擦除形式：`PluginDef { key: RuntimeKey, name, inject: Arc<InjectSpec>, provide, decode: fn(&Value) -> Result<ErasedConfig, ValidationError>, apply: Arc<dyn Fn(Context, ErasedConfig) -> BoxFuture<'static, Result<(), PluginError>> + Send + Sync> }`。对于带类型的插件，`RuntimeKey` 是 `TypeId::of::<P>()`；对于闭包插件，它是指针身份（动态模块会添加自己的键类别，见加载器内部）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"949":{"id":"/docs/development-design-67","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#plugin-trait","content":"在代码中（`plugin.rs`、`registry.rs`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"950":{"id":"/docs/development-design-68","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#plugin-trait","content":"`Plugin` 有 `const NAME`、`type Config`、`fn inject() -> Inject`（默认：空）、`fn provide() -> Vec<Key>`（默认：空）和 `fn apply(ctx: Context, config: Arc<Self::Config>) -> impl Future<Output = Result<()>> + Send`。`Inject`（有序的键，每个键可附带拦截元数据）取代了 `InjectSet` / `InjectSpec`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"951":{"id":"/docs/development-design-69","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#plugin-trait","content":"`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)`、`ctx.plugin_value::<P>(value)`、`ctx.plugin_def(&def, value)` 和 `ctx.inject(inject, f)` 返回 `kardia_core::Result<Fiber>`；`inject` 的闭包是 `Fn(Context) -> Fut`。`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)` 要求 `P::Config: Serialize`：带类型的配置会被序列化为 `Value`，然后像其他任何配置一样解码，因此只实现了 `Deserialize` 的配置要通过 `plugin_value` 以 JSON 传入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"952":{"id":"/docs/development-design-70","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#plugin-trait","content":"`PluginDef` 是 `Arc<{ key, name: Option<String>, inject, provide, tags, decode, apply }>` 的廉价克隆，通过 `PluginDef::of::<P>()`、`PluginDef::new(apply)` 或 `PluginDef::typed(apply)` 构建，并用 `.name(..)`、`.inject(..)`、`.provides(..)`、`.tag(..)`、`.validate_with(..)` 细化。`RuntimeKey` 是 `Type(TypeId)` 或 `Def(u64)`（由计数器分配的身份，用于基于闭包的定义）。动态模块复用 `Def`；它们不添加自己的键类别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"953":{"id":"/docs/development-design-71","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#configuration","content":"配置以 `serde_json::Value` 的形式到达（来自文件、加载器 API 或 `plugin_value`），并在每次（重新）加载尝试中用 `serde_path_to_error` **一次性**解码，产生 `ValidationError { issues: Vec<Issue { path, message }> }`，即 Standard Schema issues 的对应物。未知字段会被容忍，除非插件选择启用 `deny_unknown_fields`（仓库规则：容忍未知字段）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"954":{"id":"/docs/development-design-72","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#configuration","content":"`Fiber::update(value)`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"955":{"id":"/docs/development-design-73","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#configuration","content":"先校验（被拒绝的配置不会影响正在运行的实例）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"956":{"id":"/docs/development-design-74","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#configuration","content":"发出 `ConfigCommitted`（加载器回写），除非指定了 `no_save`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"957":{"id":"/docs/development-design-75","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#configuration","content":"把新配置交给插件的**更新钩子**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"958":{"id":"/docs/development-design-76","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#configuration","content":"如果没有钩子接受它，则 `restart()`（`revision += 1` → 新目标 → 卸载 → 重新加载）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"959":{"id":"/docs/development-design-77","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#configuration","content":"注册钩子是一个效应：`ctx.on_config_update::<P>(|new| async { …; Ok(Handled::Yes) })`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"960":{"id":"/docs/development-design-78","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#configuration","content":"在代码中，`Fiber::update(value)` 和 `Fiber::update_with(value, no_save)` 返回 `Result<Settle>`：校验错误会立即返回，而 `Settle` future 在更新生效时完成（`db.update(json!(..))?.await?`）。更新钩子是 `ctx.on_update::<C>(|new: &C| -> bool)`（返回 `true` 表示接管该更新，不重启）或 `ctx.on_update_with::<C>(..)`（返回 `update` 最终完成时所等待的 future）；`C` 是插件解码后的配置类型。在插件自己解码之前，配置会先经过根上的配置钩子（`ctx.on_config(..)`），加载器用它来对表达式求值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"961":{"id":"/docs/development-design-79","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#lifecycle","content":"对 `_checkImpl` / `_refresh` / `_setEpoch` / `_reload` / `_unload` / `_updateState` 的忠实移植，拆分为返回动作的纯临界区：","locale":"zh-CN"},"962":{"id":"/docs/development-design-80","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#lifecycle","content":"`begin` 设置状态，创建 `inertia` 共享 future，并在离开 `Active` 时为每个仍处于绑定状态的提供发出通知（L-Leave 先于任何逆操作）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"963":{"id":"/docs/development-design-81","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#lifecycle","content":"`finish_reload`：如果目标没有变化 → `Active`（如果 apply 出错则为 `Failed`；错误只有在仍然是当前的情况下才会被记录，因此一次已被取代的失败只会做清理）；否则衔接到 `unload`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"964":{"id":"/docs/development-design-82","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#lifecycle","content":"`finish_unload`：从每个已提交实现的 `dependents` 中移除自身，并唤醒那些依赖者集合变为空的提供者；然后进入 `Inactive`（再由 `settled_state()` 转为 `Pending`/`Failed`/`Disposed`），或者在目标不再是 ⊥ 时衔接到 `reload`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"965":{"id":"/docs/development-design-83","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#lifecycle","content":"`wait_until` 使用 `Notify`，并在释放锁*之前*注册 `Notified::enable()`（不会丢失唤醒）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"966":{"id":"/docs/development-design-84","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#lifecycle","content":"代码对工作的拆分略有不同（`lifecycle.rs`）。`refresh` 计算目标并调用 `set_target`（`_setEpoch` 的移植），后者记录目标，并且除非纤程已失败或有转换正在进行（`inertia: bool`），否则调用 `begin_reload`（提交 ω := resolved、注册为依赖者、记录生命周期片段、排队 `Action::Reload`）或 `begin_unload`（排队 `Action::Unload`），并更新状态；`update_state` 发出 `StatusChanged`，并在进入或离开 `Active` 时通知该纤程仍然有效的提供的消费者。派生的 `reload` 先让出执行（以合并已被取代的更新），然后读取插件及其配置（`prepare_execute`），通过配置钩子解析配置，以 `catch_unwind` 运行 `apply`，并调用 `finish_reload`。`unload` 等待直到该纤程的所有绑定都没有依赖者，按从新到旧的顺序清空累积器（`start_drain`），用 `join_all` 并发释放所有效应，记录失败，并调用 `finish_unload`。`wait_until` 在检查谓词之前，先在根级的通知器上注册 `Notified::enable()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"967":{"id":"/docs/development-design-85","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#instantiation","content":"`ctx.plugin(..)` 创建 `FiberData`（新的 `FiberId`、子 `Scope`），解析依赖声明，并在**父**纤程上注册一个效应：其效应体把纤程插入它的运行时并运行 `refresh`，其逆操作把它标记为已移除、把目标强制设为 ⊥、等待转换链完成并最终落定为 `Disposed`（TS `fiber.ts:178-206`）。因此，卸载父纤程会通过父纤程的累积器级联到子纤程；重新启用会创建一个*全新的*纤程（论文 §4.4，Configuration）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"968":{"id":"/docs/development-design-86","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#replace","content":"`registry.replace(old, new)`（别名 + 对每个纤程执行 `_replace`：新运行时、新依赖声明、重新解析、清除错误、`revision += 1`、refresh）按原样移植；它是 HMR 背后的原语，本身也很有用（在仍然存活的纤程背后替换实现）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"969":{"id":"/docs/development-design-87","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#replace","content":"在代码中：`ctx.registry().replace(&old_def, &new_def) -> Vec<Fiber>` 返回被移到新定义的纤程，每个被移动的纤程都会发出 `Replaced`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"970":{"id":"/docs/development-design-88","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#fiber-handle","content":"在代码中（`fiber.rs`）：`context()` 返回 `&Context`。`settled()`、`restart()` 和 `fail(error)` 返回一个 `Settle`（`kardia_core::Result<()>` 的装箱 future），`dispose()` 返回一个 `Disposal`（`Result<()>` 的 future；释放根纤程会重启它，撤销其上注册的所有内容），`update(config)` / `update_with(config, no_save)` 返回 `Result<Settle>`。此外还有 `config()`、`inject()`、`error()`、`runtime()`、`def()`、`name()`、`parent()`、`is_removed()`、`is_root()`、`effect_handle()` 和 `effect_count()`。`ctx.fiber()` 返回某个上下文所属的纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"971":{"id":"/docs/development-design-89","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#typed-events","content":"监听器按事件的 `TypeId` 存放在 `IdTable` 中；注册监听器是监听器所在纤程的一个效应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"972":{"id":"/docs/development-design-90","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#typed-events","content":"分发时对表做快照，并跳过已移除的监听器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"973":{"id":"/docs/development-design-91","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#typed-events","content":"可选的领域过滤（`E: Scoped`）为 `ServiceChanged` 重现了 `Context.filter`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"974":{"id":"/docs/development-design-92","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#typed-events","content":"瀑布式的扩展点（`internal/config`、`internal/get`、`internal/update`）被**显式的钩子 trait**（加载器的配置变换钩子、每个纤程的更新钩子、提交钩子）取代，而不是使用以字符串区分的事件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"975":{"id":"/docs/development-design-93","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#typed-events","content":"内部事件：`PluginInserted/Removed`、`StatusChanged { fiber, old, new }`、`ServiceChanged { key, realm }`、`ConfigCommitted { fiber, value }`、`Replaced { fiber }`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"976":{"id":"/docs/development-design-94","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#typed-events","content":"在代码中（`events.rs`）：`trait Event: Any + Send + Sync { type Output: Bailable; fn filter(&self, listener: &Context) -> bool { true } }`。`Bailable`（为 `()`、`bool`、`Option<T>` 和 `Result<T, Error>` 实现）规定哪些结果会终止一次 `bail` / `serial` 分发，以及哪些结果算作 `parallel` 分发的失败。`filter` 取代了 `E: Scoped`：`ServiceChanged` 只会到达那些其上下文把该键解析到同一领域的监听器。监听器按 `TypeId` 保存在 `Vec` 中。`on` 返回 `Result<EffectHandle>`；此外还有 `on_prepend`、`on_async`、`once` 和 `listener_count`。钩子是 `ctx.on_config(..)`（配置变换）、`ctx.on_update::<C>(..)`（每个纤程的更新钩子），以及作为提交点的 `ConfigCommitted` 事件。`ConfigCommitted` 携带 `{ fiber, config }`。`serial` 返回 `Result<Option<E::Output>>`：发生 panic 的监听器会以该 panic 作为错误中止它；而 `emit` 和 `bail` 会记录发生 panic 的监听器（无论同步还是异步）并继续执行（见事件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"977":{"id":"/docs/development-design-95","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#logger","content":"`Logger` 是一个核心服务：","locale":"zh-CN"},"978":{"id":"/docs/development-design-96","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#logger","content":"`ctx.logger(name)` → `Logger { name, level, fiber }`（名称默认是调用方纤程的运行时名称，可被拦截元数据 `{ name, level }` 覆盖）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"979":{"id":"/docs/development-design-97","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#logger","content":"通过 `logger.exporter(e)` **以效应的形式**注册的 `Exporter` trait 对象；","locale":"zh-CN"},"980":{"id":"/docs/development-design-98","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#logger","content":"保存最近 1000 条 `Message { sn, ts, name, level, args }` 的环形缓冲区。","locale":"zh-CN"},"981":{"id":"/docs/development-design-99","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#logger","content":"格式字符串使用 Rust 的格式化（`format_args!`），而不是 printf 指令。可以在 `kardia-logger-console` 中添加一个 `tracing` 桥接（一个向导出器输送数据的 `tracing_subscriber::Layer`）；核心并不需要它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"982":{"id":"/docs/development-design-100","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#logger","content":"在代码中（`logger.rs`）：`ctx.logger()` 不接受名称（它由 `intercept(\"logger\", { name })` 命名，或以纤程的插件命名），`ctx.logger_named(name)` 显式地为它命名，`svc.logger()` 代表调用者记录日志。级别有 `error`、`warn`、`info` 和 `debug`，每个都接受 `impl Display`，因此可以直接使用 `format_args!(..)`。导出器通过 `ctx.add_exporter(Arc<dyn Exporter>)` 注册，这是当前纤程的一个效应；`Exporter::export(&Message)`，以及可选的按名称设置的 `level`。`Message` 是 `{ sn, ts, name, level, text, fiber }`：文本已经格式化（见日志器）。缓冲区默认保存 1000 条消息（`ctx.log_buffer()`、`ctx.set_log_buffer_size(n)`）。尚未添加 `tracing` 桥接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"983":{"id":"/docs/development-design-101","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"Crate","locale":"zh-CN"},"984":{"id":"/docs/development-design-102","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"移植自","locale":"zh-CN"},"985":{"id":"/docs/development-design-103","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"Rust 构件","locale":"zh-CN"},"986":{"id":"/docs/development-design-104","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"`kardia-timer`","locale":"zh-CN"},"987":{"id":"/docs/development-design-105","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"`plugin-timer`","locale":"zh-CN"},"988":{"id":"/docs/development-design-106","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"以 `tokio::time::{sleep, interval}`、`JoinHandle::abort` 作为撤销函数；`timeout(d) -> Result<(), Disposed>` future；`interval(d) -> impl Stream`；`throttle/debounce` 句柄","locale":"zh-CN"},"989":{"id":"/docs/development-design-107","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"`kardia-logger-console`","locale":"zh-CN"},"990":{"id":"/docs/development-design-108","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"`plugin-logger-console`","locale":"zh-CN"},"991":{"id":"/docs/development-design-109","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"ANSI 颜色、标签对齐、级别映射","locale":"zh-CN"},"992":{"id":"/docs/development-design-110","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"`kardia-fs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"993":{"id":"/docs/development-design-111","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"`plugin-fs-node`","locale":"zh-CN"},"994":{"id":"/docs/development-design-112","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"`notify`（对单个文件则监视其父目录）、`globset` + 移植的“最后匹配者胜出”/祖先谓词","locale":"zh-CN"},"995":{"id":"/docs/development-design-113","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#built-ins","content":"代码中的定时器 API（`Svc<Timer>` 上的 `TimerExt`）：`timeout(delay, callback)` 和 `interval(delay, callback)` 是返回 `Result<EffectHandle>` 的效应；`sleep(delay)` 是一个 future，如果调用者先被释放，它会以 `Disposed` 失败；`ticks(delay)` 返回 `Ticks`，其 `tick().await` 在下一次触发时完成（而不是一个 `Stream`）；`throttle` 和 `debounce` 返回 `Scheduled<A>` 句柄。`ctx.timer()`（`TimerContext`）是 `ctx.get::<Timer>()` 的简写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"996":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","type":"page","content":"核心数据结构","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-lifecycle","locale":"zh-CN"},"997":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-0","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle","content":"kardia-core 中的标识符、作用域覆盖层、绑定、纤程、目标与已提交视图、IdTable 以及依赖环检测。","locale":"zh-CN"},"998":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-1","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#identifiers","content":"标识符（`key.rs`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"999":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-2","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#scope","content":"作用域覆盖层（`scope.rs`）：派生实现与实时重新挂接父节点","locale":"zh-CN"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-3","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#bindings","content":"绑定（`store.rs`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-4","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#fibers","content":"纤程（`fiber.rs`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-5","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#id-table","content":"`IdTable<T>`：天然可交换的注册表","locale":"zh-CN"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-6","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#cycle-detection","content":"依赖环检测（D9）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1004":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-7","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle","content":"`kardia-core` 的核心数据结构：生命周期所依托的状态。纤程（fiber）存放在注册表（registry）的 arena 中，以永不复用的 id 寻址；每一个交叉引用（父纤程、依赖者、已提交视图（committed view））都是 id，而不是指针（指导决策中的决策 **D2**）。推动纤程在各状态间转换的算法（refresh、reload、unload、实例化）位于 API 设计页的生命周期状态机一节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1005":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-8","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle","content":"本页的草图是计划中的设计。代码保留了它们的含义，但并不总是保留它们的形态；每个草图下方的说明给出了 `crates/kardia-core/src` 中当前的名称和字段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-9","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#identifiers","content":"永不复用的 id 实现了论文中的原子生成式名称，并使“被一个相等的值替换”变得可观察（Def. 53）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-10","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#identifiers","content":"在代码中：`Key`、`RealmId`、`ImplId` 和 `FiberId` 与草图一致（`FiberId::ROOT` 为 `0`，`RealmId::new()` 创建一个新的领域（realm））。`RealmId` 打印为 `realm#n`；可读的标签 `svc#id` / `svc@label` 属于加载器的领域。没有 `EffectId`：效应（effect）是存放在 `IdTable` 中的 `EffectCell`，其 id 是普通的 `u64`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-11","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#scope","content":"它取代了 JS 的原型链（`Object.create`、`setPrototypeOf`、`swap`）。自有与继承的区分是显式的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-12","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#scope","content":"在代码中，一个 `Scope` 是上下文派生链上的一个节点：`Scope { parent: RwLock<Option<Arc<Scope>>>, kind: ScopeKind }`，其中 `ScopeKind::{Fiber(FiberId), Isolate(Key, RealmId), Intercept(Key, Value), Overlay(Arc<Overlay>)}`。每个派生上下文（纤程自己的上下文、`isolate`、`intercept`、`extend`）都会添加一个节点；重新指向某个父节点会移动它下面的一切。加载器中按条目划分的可变表是公开的 `Overlay` 节点（`set_isolations`、`set_intercepts`），而条目标记是一个 `Overlay::tagged(tag)`，可通过 `Context::tag()` 重新找到。由于作用域节点携带着各自的纤程，一次访问的纤程链可以直接从派生链上读出（见可重新指向的上下文）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-13","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#bindings","content":"`type_id` 检查对应论文 §6.6。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-14","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#bindings","content":"在代码中，这两个结构体都位于 `state.rs`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-15","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#bindings","content":"`Impl` 有 `key`、`realm`、`provider`、`provider_scope`、`value`、`check: Option<Check>`、`view: Option<View>`（值的 JSON 视图，供表达式和工具使用）以及 `dependents`。它没有 `id`（绑定在 `State::impls` 中以 `ImplId` 为键），没有 `type_id`（键冲突表现为值向下转型失败时的 `AccessError::TypeMismatch`），也没有 `released` 通知器（卸载守卫在根级通知器上等待）。`Check` 是 `Arc<dyn Fn(&[Value]) -> bool + Send + Sync>`：它接收消费者针对该键的拦截元数据，并在锁内运行，因此不得调用运行时（runtime）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-16","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#bindings","content":"`State` 有 `fibers`、`runtimes: IndexMap<RuntimeKey, RuntimeData>`（按注册顺序）、`aliases: HashMap<RuntimeKey, PluginDef>`、`impls: HashMap<ImplId, Impl>`（每个仍然存在的绑定，无论是活跃的，还是已撤回但仍被引用的）、`store: HashMap<RealmId, ImplId>`（每个领域的活跃绑定，即论文的 Σ）、`root_realms`、`listeners`（按事件 `TypeId`）、`config_hooks`、id 计数器以及排队的 `actions`。没有 `props` 表：访问器（accessor）和混入（mixin）未被移植（见关联属性）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-17","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#fibers","content":"`FiberState` 即论文中的 θ。处于 `Failed` 的纤程只能通过 `update`、`restart` 或 `replace` 恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-18","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#fibers","content":"在代码中（`state.rs` 和 `fiber.rs`），`FiberState` 和 `Target` 与草图一致，只是 `Target::Epoch::providers` 是 `Vec<ImplId>`（工作区不使用 `smallvec`）。`FiberData` 有所不同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-19","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#fibers","content":"没有 `id`（它是 `State::fibers` 的键），`runtime: Option<RuntimeKey>`（根纤程没有运行时），`inject: Inject`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-20","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#fibers","content":"`config: Value` 是原样给出的源配置；它在每次加载尝试时解码一次，而不是以带类型的形式存储。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-21","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#fibers","content":"`episode: Option<Target>`：当前生命周期片段（episode）加载时所针对的目标，迭代检查点会与它比较。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-22","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#fibers","content":"`committed: Option<HashMap<Key, ImplId>>`；没有 `CommittedView` 类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-23","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#fibers","content":"`inertia: bool`：有一个转换正在进行。等待（`Fiber::settled()`、卸载守卫）使用 `RootInner::wait_until` 在根级通知器上等待，而不是使用每个纤程各自的 `unload_gate` 或 `watch` 通道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-24","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#fibers","content":"`error: Option<Error>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-25","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#fibers","content":"`provisions: Vec<ImplId>`，外加 `draining` 和 `withdrawn`（在排空期间撤回的提供项，在排空结束之前对该纤程的后代仍然可见）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-26","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#fibers","content":"`disposables: IdTable<Arc<EffectCell>>`、`update_hooks: IdTable<Arc<UpdateHook>>`，以及 `retire: Option<Arc<EffectCell>>`（父纤程上实例化该纤程的那个效应，O-Insert）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-27","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#id-table","content":"`DisposableList` 的设计（插入返回一个新的 id；按 id 移除；`drain_rev()` 按 LIFO 顺序返回）以 `kardia_core::IdTable<T>` 的形式公开导出。它就是论文 §3.4.2 所说的可交换键：服务作者应在它之上构建自己的注册表（路由、监听器、命令）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-28","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#cycle-detection","content":"插入时，计算由声明的 `provide`/`inject` 得到的优先关系 ≺（`p_n ∩ d_m ≠ ∅`）是否在同一领域内未释放的纤程之间构成环；若是，则记录一条指出该环的警告，并让纤程保持 `Pending`（其余行为不变）。它只读取声明，因此可以提前计算（论文 §6.5）。声明的 `provide` 只是元数据（与 Cordis 中相同）；提供了未声明键的插件只会绕过这项检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/development-lifecycle-29","page_id":"/docs/development-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-lifecycle#cycle-detection","content":"已在 `registry.rs` 中实现（`warn_cycle`）：沿着“依赖于一个声明的提供者”的边做深度优先搜索，以警告级别记录 `dependency cycle: a -> b -> …`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/development-loader","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","type":"page","content":"加载器、include 与动态模块","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-loader","locale":"zh-CN"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-0","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader","content":"kardia-loader、kardia-include 与 kardia-hmr 的内部实现：Cordis 加载器的 Rust 适配、基于文件的 include，以及热重载算法及其模块后端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-1","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"`kardia-loader`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-2","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-loader#include","content":"`kardia-include`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-3","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"动态模块与 HMR（`kardia-hmr`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-4","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader","content":"本页介绍 Cordis 的加载器、include（配置文件引入）与 HMR 包是如何移植的：数据模型、条目状态机、文件同步与模块图。用法见指南页面加载器、热重载与访客插件；TypeScript 原版见 Cordis 参考中的加载器、include 与分组以及 HMR。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1033":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-5","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"`packages/loader` 的移植，做了以下 Rust 适配：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-6","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"主题","locale":"zh-CN"},"1035":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-7","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"适配","locale":"zh-CN"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-8","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**数据模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1037":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-9","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"`EntryOptions` 是一个 serde 结构体，带有 `#[serde(flatten)] extra: IndexMap<String, Value>`（容忍未知键）；用 `Option<Option<T>>`/`Value::Null` 表示“合并时删除”；`IsolateLabel::{Private, Shared(String)}`；`Disabled::{Bool, Expr}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-10","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**以 id 寻址的文档代替对象同一性**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1039":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-11","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"TS 依赖 `entry.options === group.data[i]`；Rust 以分组的 `Vec<EntryOptions>` 为准，条目持有 id；“来自文件”是一个来源标志，而不是 `===`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-12","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**条目状态机**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-13","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"`update / _patchContext / _reconcile / init / _init / _start` 一比一移植，沿用“每次 await 之后重新检查”的写法（`fn still_current(&self, snap) -> bool`），`_initTask` 为 `Option<Shared<..>>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-14","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**带 `inject` 的条目使用两个纤程（fiber）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-15","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"保留外层的依赖持有者与内层的插件：外层 `apply` 从目录中解析插件，经过 `ctx.checkpoint().await?`，然后启动内层纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-16","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**目录（Catalog）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-17","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"代替模块导入：`Catalog::register::<P>()` / `register_alias(\"@cordisjs/plugin-group\", Group)`；缺失的名称产生 `ModuleNotFound`，定位到条目的 `name`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-18","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**托管领域（realm）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-19","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"`LocalRealm`/`GlobalRealm` 作为带标签的 `RealmId`；忠实移植 7 步的 `patch-context` 算法，其中分界测试通过沿作用域父链直接计算（`scope.is_within(entry_marker)`），而不是借助临时 symbol；提供者迁移无需重启；被阻止的移动记录在 `Impl::realm` 中。**修复**领域回收中过早的 `return`（改用 `continue`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-20","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**自我释放 / 自我更新的回写**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-21","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"核心传递 `DisposeReason { SelfRequested, Parent, Loader }`，代替 TS 的 `_disposing` 标志加“先注销再释放”的技巧（一项有意的破坏性简化）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-22","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**`loader` 等待屏障**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-23","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"`Loader::settled().await`，以及由原子任务计数器驱动的可用性检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-24","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**校验**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-25","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"在边界处调用 `validate_options(&Value, deep) -> Vec<Issue>`（API 调用做深层校验，文件输入做浅层校验）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-26","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**表达式**（`!!js`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1055":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-27","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"JS 的 `with(ctx) eval` 无法移植。待定决策（风险）：采用一种无副作用的表达式语言（推荐 CEL，或一个小型自定义求值器），其标识符通过 `ctx.get_dyn(name)` 和可序列化的服务视图（`trait ExprValue { fn to_value(&self) -> Value }`）解析，并遵循与 TS 加载器相同的求值上下文表。在此之前，`Expr` 值会被拒绝，并给出明确的校验问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-28","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"`kardia-loader` 与上表的不同之处：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-29","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**数据模型**：`EntryOptions` 是一个带类型的视图，从已被 `validate_options` 接受的选项中读取（`EntryOptions::read`）；JSON 对象仍是唯一可信来源，因此未知键无需 `flatten` 映射即可在回写中保留。`IsolateLabel::{Private, Shared(String)}` 与 `Disabled::{Bool(bool), Expr(String)}` 与计划一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-30","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**目录**：`Catalog::register::<P>()`、`register_def(name, def)` 与 `alias(alias, name)`（而不是 `register_alias`）；`kardia_loader::builtins()` 注册 `group` 并把 `@cordisjs/plugin-group` 设为它的别名，`kardia::catalog()` 再以名称及其 JavaScript 包名添加其他内置插件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-31","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**检查点**：同步的，`ctx.checkpoint()?`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-32","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**托管领域**：分界测试是在条目表为带标记的 `Overlay` 节点的上下文上调用 `Context::is_within(..)`；领域回收的修复已完成（`collect_realms` 使用 `continue`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-33","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**自我释放**：没有引入 `DisposeReason`。加载器在它自己的 `fiber.dispose()` 调用前后设置每个条目的 `disposing` 标志（`entry.rs`，`dispose_fiber`），与 TS 的 `_disposing` 标志是同一种模式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-34","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**表达式**：实现为一个无副作用的 JavaScript 子集（`kardia_loader::expr`），而不是 CEL；标识符通过服务的 JSON 视图（`ctx.view(name)`，由 `provide_serialized_as` 提供）解析，而不是通过 `ExprValue` trait；见表达式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-35","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#loader","content":"**键顺序**：选项是 `serde_json` 映射；只有开启 `preserve-order` 特性时，`sort_keys` 才能让回写得到稳定的顺序（`id`、`name`，其余按字母序，`config` 最后）。该特性开启 `serde_json/preserve_order`，默认开启。Cargo 会把这个特性统一到构建中的每个 `serde_json::Map`，所以它是可选的：关闭时，映射与回写都按字母序列出键。`kardia-include` 与 `kardia` 门面开启它；`kardia-hmr` 把它作为默认特性透传，因此关闭 `kardia-hmr`（以及 `kardia-loader`）默认特性的应用保留 serde_json 的默认映射。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-36","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#include","content":"**纯模块**，几乎逐字移植并单独进行单元测试：`journal`（记录、合并、展平、应用、三方 `reconcile`；以文件为准）、`patch`（插入/覆盖补丁、`PatchIndex` 归属、`route_journal`）、匿名 id 分配。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-37","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#include","content":"**IO 循环**：一个由 `dirty_read/dirty_write` 标志加 `Notify` 驱动的任务；树的应用以最新者为准；`flush()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-38","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#include","content":"**解析**：一个支持位置信息（span）和自定义标签的 YAML 解析器（`saphyr` 系列）：`!!js` → `Value::Expr`；错误**和**警告都是致命的；JSON 通过 `serde_json` 解析，并额外做一遍带位置信息的处理以获取位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1067":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-39","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#include","content":"**原子写入**：在同一目录中写临时文件，每次重命名前检查内容是否已过期，遇到 `PermissionDenied`/`ResourceBusy` 时进行有限次数的重试，只读时 → 把 journal 保留在内存中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-40","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#include","content":"**错误**：使用结构化的 `ConfigFrame { id, file, line, col }` 链，而不是改写后的栈字符串。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1069":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-41","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#include","content":"在代码中，`serde_json::Value` 没有表达式变体：`!!js` 变为对象 `{ \"__jsExpr\": \"…\" }`（`kardia_loader::EXPR_KEY`）。错误是 `ConfigFileError` / `ConfigIssue` 值，其位置为 `file:line:col`，加载器把带位置的帧打印为文本（`at <id> (file:line:col)`），而不是使用 `ConfigFrame` 类型；见错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-42","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"可选，第 7 阶段。论文 §6.4：*原生代码不暴露模块注册表，因此引入与撤回采取显式动态链接（dlopen/dlclose）的形式……WebAssembly……在原生嵌入方（例如 Wasmtime）丢弃它时释放*。计划把**算法**（可移植）与**模块技术**（一个后端）分开：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-43","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"在代码中（`graph.rs`）：`trait ModuleSource: Send + Sync + 'static { fn load(&self, id: &str) -> Result<ModuleCode>; }`。`ModuleId` 是一个 `String`（绝对路径），`ModuleCode { deps: Vec<ModuleId>, evaluate }` 基于其依赖的导出进行求值，模块导出 `Exports::{None, Plugin(PluginDef), Value(Value)}`。`ModuleGraph::new(source)` 维护一张已加载记录（`deps`、`exports`）的有序表，以及宿主模块的集合。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1072":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-44","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"宿主持有一个 `ModuleGraph { records: HashMap<ModuleId, ModuleRecord { deps, kind: Host|Dynamic, instance } > }`，代替 Node 的缓存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1073":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-45","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"Cordis 的协调（reconcile）算法被移植为纯粹的图代码，测试来自 `reconcile.spec.ts`。这遵循的是**代码**，而不是论文的算法 10（见 HMR：论文与代码对照）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-46","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"事务串行执行，并通过任务局部的事务 id 拒绝重入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-47","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"后端，按优先顺序：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1076":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-48","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"**WASM 组件（wasmtime）**：新旧实例可以安全共存，丢弃是可靠的，天然沙箱（论文 §6.3 的桥接纤程）。代价：服务需要跨越 WIT 边界。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1077":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-49","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"**dylib（`libloading`）**：仅用于开发期：相同的工具链，每个版本从一个唯一的复制路径加载，**永不卸载**（由于 TLS 析构函数和泄漏的 `'static` 引用，卸载 Rust dylib 是不可靠的），C-ABI 入口点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1078":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-50","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"**进程外插件**（重新派生进程 = 重新加载），采用论文 §6.2 的服务代理/RPC 模式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-51","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"静态链接的插件天然就是“宿主模块”；修改它们需要重启进程，而运行中的*重新*配置仍由加载器完整支持。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/development-loader-52","page_id":"/docs/development-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-loader#hmr","content":"三种后端都已实现：`WasmSource`（核心 WASM 模块，而不是 WIT 组件）、`DylibSource` 与 `ProcessSource`，它们共享同一套 JSON 访客 ABI，另有 `kardia-guest` 用于以 Rust 编写访客插件。监视模式是 `HmrConfig { base, watch }`。它们与本计划的不同之处，完整说明见动态模块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/development-risks","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","type":"page","content":"风险与完整示例","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-risks","locale":"zh-CN"},"1082":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-0","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks","content":"kardia 设计中的风险与待定决策及其建议答案，以及一个插件 API 的完整示例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-1","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"风险与待定决策","locale":"zh-CN"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-2","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"完整示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1085":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-3","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"主题","locale":"zh-CN"},"1086":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-4","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"风险 / 问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"1087":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-5","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"建议答案","locale":"zh-CN"},"1088":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-6","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"线程模型","locale":"zh-CN"},