id":"/docs/development-risks-37","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"**动态代码**：先实现了静态目录；随后实现了 WASM、dylib 与进程后端（见动态模块）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-38","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"**类型级的键**：进程内的检查是访问时的向下转型（`AccessError::TypeMismatch`）。访客插件的服务以 JSON 值和 JSON 调用跨越模块边界（`GuestService`），因此没有任何 Rust 类型或 `TypeId` 跨越边界。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-39","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"一个提供者和一个消费者，基于插件 API 编写。第一个标签页是用现行 API 写的示例（只要提供 `connect` 及其连接池——它们是真实数据库客户端的占位——它就能针对工作区编译并运行）；第二个是计划中针对当时尚未实现的 API 的原始草图。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-40","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"草图与代码之间的变化：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-41","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**根**：`Context::new()` 创建根上下文；`root.fiber().dispose()` 代替 `root.shutdown()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-42","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**错误**：`Result<()>`（`kardia_core::Result`）代替 `Result<(), PluginError>` 与 `anyhow::Result`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-43","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**声明**：`fn inject() -> Inject`（此处为 `Inject::of::<(Database,)>()`）代替 `type Inject`，`fn provide() -> Vec<Key>` 代替 `&'static [&'static str]` 切片。`#[derive(Service)]` 实现 `Service`（手写的 `impl Service for Database` 同样可用）。使用 `#[plugin]` 宏时，插件是一个接受 `Injected<(Database,)>` 的 `async fn`，这会把未声明的访问变成编译错误（见插件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-44","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**边界**：`ctx.checkpoint()?` 与 `ctx.on_dispose(..)?` 是同步且可能失败的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-45","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**配置**：`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)` 要求 `P::Config: Serialize`（该值会像其他任何配置一样被序列化再解码），因此只实现了 `Deserialize` 的配置要通过 `plugin_value` 以 JSON 传入。`db.update(value)?` 立即校验，并返回需要 await 的 future；`update_with(value, no_save)` 接受该标志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-46","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**等待稳定**：只要没有正在进行的转换，`greeter.settled()` 就会立即完成，因此示例先等待 `db` 稳定；数据库被提供之后，greeter 的转换才会开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-47","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**日志**：`ctx.logger_named(\"greeter\")`，或 `ctx.logger()`，后者以插件名命名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-48","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**依赖**：`#[derive(Deserialize)]` 需要在 crate 自身的依赖中加入启用 `derive` 特性的 `serde`，即使 `kardia::prelude` 重新导出了该 derive。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/development-status","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"page","content":"状态与偏离","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status","locale":"zh-CN"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/development-status-0","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status","content":"kardia 的实现阶段及其退出标准、实现状态，以及实现偏离计划或 TypeScript 代码的每一处。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/development-status-1","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/developme