id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"CI（`.github/workflows/ci.yml`）在改动 Rust 代码的推送和拉取请求上，在固定的工具链（Rust 1.99.1）上运行 `cargo fmt --check`、将警告视为错误的 clippy、`cargo xtask arch` 以及测试套件，因为 `kardia-macros` 的编译错误快照会随编译器而变化。推送 `v*` 标签会运行 `release.yml`：复用 CI 对该标签所指提交的运行结果，然后对 crates.io 上尚不存在的每个 crate 版本执行 `cargo publish --workspace`，并等待 crates.io 对新 crate 的数量限制过去，最后创建 GitHub Release。该工作流也可以手动启动，以继续一次中途停止的发布。参与开发逐步描述了这些工作流。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/development-status-48","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"以下是实现偏离本计划或 TypeScript 代码之处。其中三项较长，在表格下方各有一个小节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/development-status-49","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"主题","locale":"zh-CN"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/development-status-50","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"实现","locale":"zh-CN"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/development-status-51","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"已退役的提供者","locale":"zh-CN"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/development-status-52","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"由属性测试发现：退役一个纤程会立即解除其存活的提供，因此后继者可以在同一领域中提供服务，而旧的消费者仍在排空（它们通过自己的已提交视图读取）。TS 代码会一直保留该槽位直到排空结束，并使后继者失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/development-status-53","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"过期的加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/development-status-54","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"已退役纤程仍在进行中的加载可以注册逆操作（因此它获取的任何东西都不会泄漏），但不能注册提供。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/development-status-5