置插件的条目名都是访客模块路径，相对于配置文件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1891":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests","content":"所有后端都使用同一套基于 JSON 的**访客 ABI**（见下文），并通过一个桥接插件运行每个访客插件：桥接插件为每个纤程（fiber）实例化一次访客，并在纤程被释放（dispose）时丢弃该实例。Rust SDK `kardia-guest` 可以用同一份源码为所有后端编写这样的访客。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1892":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"WebAssembly（`WasmSource`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1893":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"动态库（`DylibSource`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1894":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"子进程（`ProcessSource`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1895":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1896":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`.wasm`，或 `.wat` 文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"1897":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`.so` / `.dylib` / `.dll`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1898":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"可执行文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1899":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"运行方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1900":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"在 wasmtime 上，每个纤程一个 store","locale":"zh-CN"},"1901":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"在宿主（host）进程内","locale":"zh-CN"},"1902":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"每个纤程一个子进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"1903":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"隔离","locale":"zh-CN"},"1904":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"沙箱，可选燃料、时间和内存限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"1905":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"无：库中的崩溃会使整个应用崩溃","locale":"zh-CN"},"1906":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"崩溃的访客只会让它自己的插件失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1907":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"重载","locale":"zh-CN"},"1908":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"每个版本编译一次；新旧实例并存，丢弃实例会释放其全部内存","locale":"zh-CN"},"1909":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"每个版本从一份新副本加载，**永不卸载**；一直保留到进程退出","locale":"zh-CN"},"1910":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"重载模块会重新启动其进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"1911":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"适用于","locale":"zh-CN"},"1912":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"生产环境的访客","locale":"zh-CN"},"1913":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"开发：同一套工具链，无需 WASM 目标","locale":"zh-CN"},"1914":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"任意语言编写的访客，或不能让宿主崩溃的访客","locale":"zh-CN"},"1915":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`kardia` 二进制","locale":"zh-CN"},"1916":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"支持","locale":"zh-CN"},"1917":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"支持","locale":"zh-CN"},"1918":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"暂不支持（仅限库）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1919":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**WebAssembly。** `WasmSource` 在 wasmtime 上运行核心 WebAssembly 模块，而不是 WIT 组件，因此访客不需要组件工具链（测试用 WAT 编写）。模块每个版本编译一次，并为每个纤程在各自的 store 中实例化。`WasmSource::with_limits` 为每个实例设置上限：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1920":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"燃料或时间耗尽的导出会触发陷阱（trap），该实例之后的调用以 `the guest was stopped: …` 失败；内存增长超过上限也会触发陷阱。设置了时间上限时，调用者自己的截止时间（`call_timeout`、`call_async`）同样生效。`WasmSource::new()` 不设置任何上限。这些失败都是带类型的 `GuestFailure`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1921":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"要像 `ProcessGuest::plugin` 那样从外部给出 WASM 插件的元数据，可以把模块编译为 `WasmGuest`：`WasmGuest::new(bytes, limits)` 在自己的引擎上编译 WASM 字节或 WAT 文本，`source.guest(bytes)` 则在某个 `WasmSource` 的引擎上、按它的上限编译。两者都不实例化模块。`plugin(meta)` 生成插件，每个实例启动时必须声明相同的元数据；`module(id)` 则像 `WasmSource` 那样从一个实例中读取元数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1922":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**macOS 上的陷阱处理**。在 macOS 上，wasmtime 默认通过 Mach 异常端口处理 WASM 陷阱。它的陷阱处理器是进程级的：wasmtime 在创建第一个引擎时安装它，之后的引擎若要求另一种设置，wasmtime 会 panic。`kardia::hmr::set_macos_mach_ports(false)` 让 kardia-hmr 创建的每个引擎改用 Unix 信号。请在创建第一个 `WasmSource` 或 `WasmGuest` 之前调用它：此后再要求另一种设置会返回错误，且不改变任何东西。应用自己用 wasmtime 创建的引擎必须使用相同的设置。在 macOS 以外的平台上，这个调用不改变任何东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1923":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**动态库。** `DylibSource` 使用 C ABI，而不是传递 Rust 类型：`cdylib` 自带一份 `kardia-core` 和 tokio，静态变量各自独立，也没有运行时上下文。每次加载都会把库复制到一个新路径（位于临时目录下的 `kardia-dylib-<pid>` 目录中），因为平台加载器对已知路径会直接交出已加载的那个库。库永不卸载：一旦 Rust 代码注册了线程局部析构函数或交出了 `'static` 引用，卸载它就是不健全的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1924":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**子进程。** `ProcessSource` 把每个插件实例作为独立进程运行，通过 stdin 和 stdout 以 JSON 行的形式使用访客 ABI（见进程传输）。进程结束的访客只会让它自己的插件失败；破坏协议或超过调用截止时间的访客会被杀死。命令行参数、spawner、超时和退出报告见进程访客。替换可执行文件时，请把新文件重命名覆盖到原路径：正在运行的可执行文件不能被写入，而以写方式打开着的文件不能被启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1925":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**三者的共同点。** `GuestService::call` 会阻塞调用者直到访客应答；`call_async` 则在异步工作线程之外执行调用，桥接插件执行 `apply` 和 `dispose` 时也是如此。截止时间可以终止进程访客（将其杀死）和设置了时间上限的 WASM 访客（触发陷阱）；dylib 访客运行在调用者的线程上，无法被终止。没有单独的代理（broker）服务：每个纤程的 `GuestService` 就是 RPC 端点。这些后端是 `kardia-hmr` 的 cargo 特性（`wasm`、`dylib`、`process`，默认全部开启）；另有 `preserve-order`（默认开启），它通过 `kardia-loader` 开启 `serde_json/preserve_order`，关闭它可让应用保留 serde_json 的默认映射（键顺序）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1926":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`kardia` 二进制按文件扩展名选择后端：`.wasm` 和 `.wat` 交给 `WasmSource`，其他一律交给 `DylibSource`。基于库构建的应用可以自行选择：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1927":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"访客通过 `Host::provide` 提供服务。在宿主一侧，每个这样的服务都是一个 `kardia::hmr::GuestService`，其 JSON 视图就是访客提供的值：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1928":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`GuestService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1929":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`value()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1930":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"访客提供该服务时给出的 JSON 值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1931":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`call(method, args)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1932":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"以 `{ key, method, args }` 调用访客的 `cordis_call`，返回其 JSON 结果；阻塞直到访客应答，或直到访客的默认超时","locale":"zh-CN"},"1933":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`call_timeout(method, args, timeout)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1934":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"与 `call` 相同，但超过 `timeout` 后以 `the guest did not answer in time` 失败；此时进程访客会被杀死，之后的调用也会失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1935":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`call_async(method, args, timeout)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1936":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"在异步工作线程之外执行调用，可设置超时；丢弃该 future 即取消调用（`kardia-guest/2` 访客会收到通知，其结果被丢弃）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1937":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`is_available()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1938":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"实例是否仍能应答：未被释放，且其进程没有退出","locale":"zh-CN"},"1939":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`handle()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1940":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"进程访客的 `GuestHandle`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1941":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"提供该服务的纤程消失后，调用以 `the guest instance is disposed` 失败；进程访客自行结束后，以 `the guest process exited` 失败；访客返回的不是 JSON 时，以 `invalid result of <key>.<method>: …` 失败。访客回调到一个已在同一线程上运行的实例（直接或经由其他访客）时，会以 `re-entrant call into a guest instance` 失败，而不会死锁。与任何服务一样，访客的纤程被释放时，访客服务随之撤回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1942":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`ProcessSource` 把模块 id 当作程序运行，不带参数。`ProcessGuest` 描述一条访客命令及其选项；可以直接使用，也可以在你自己的 `ModuleSource` 中使用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1943":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`ProcessGuest`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1944":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`new(command)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1945":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"运行 `command` 的访客（`GuestCommand`：程序、`arg`/`args`、`env`、`current_dir`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1946":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`spawner(spawner)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1947":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"由谁启动它的进程（见下文）；默认为 `StdSpawner`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1948":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`timeout(duration)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1949":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"调用者未设置截止时间时，每次导出可用的时长；超过后进程被杀死。默认没有，但此时 `dispose` 限定为 5 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"1950":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`handshake_timeout(duration)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1951":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"访客应答握手的时限（默认 10 秒）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1952":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`frame_limit(bytes)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1953":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"访客可发送的最长一行（默认 16 MiB）；更长的一行会使访客被杀死","locale":"zh-CN"},"1954":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`plugin(meta)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1955":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-82",