出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2498":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"一个更长、可运行的版本，还演示了热替换数据库的实现：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2499":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"使用门面 crate `kardia` 时，两个宏都要写 `crate = ::kardia`。生成的代码默认引用 `::kardia_core`，只有直接依赖 `kardia-core` 时才能用默认值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2500":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#services","content":"服务是绑定到一个**键**（key）上的任意 `Send + Sync + 'static` 类型，键是字符串。之所以用字符串而不是类型 id，是因为配置文件要通过名字引用服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2501":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#services","content":"`#[derive(Service)]` 默认把类型名转成连字符形式作为键，除非给出 `name`。`Service` trait 还有一个成员 `merge_intercept`，用于合并拦截（interception）元数据；它的默认实现（对 JSON 对象做右偏的浅合并）适用于大多数服务。见服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2502":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"插件在 `apply` 中提供服务：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2503":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2504":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"提供","locale":"zh-CN"},"2505":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"`ctx.provide(value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2506":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"一个 `Service` 值，使用它自己的键","locale":"zh-CN"},"2507":{"id":"/do