/docs/reference-auxiliary","content":"**共同主题：** 每个资源都通过*调用方*纤程（fiber）上的 `ctx.effect` 注册（经服务 tracker 找到调用方，见服务与可追溯性），因此在调用方卸载时被释放。服务中没有针对每个消费者的簿记。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3132":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-10","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"`timer/src/index.ts`。服务 `timer`，以 `ctx.timeout / interval / throttle / debounce / setTimeout / setInterval` 的形式混入上下文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3133":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-11","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"API","locale":"zh-CN"},"3134":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-12","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"语义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3135":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-13","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"`timeout(cb, ms) → dispose`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3136":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-14","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"围绕 `setTimeout` 的效应；触发时先释放自身（把该效应从纤程中移除），再调用 `cb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3137":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-15","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"`timeout(ms) → Promise<void>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3138":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-16","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"休眠；释放纤程会以 `Error('Context has been disposed')` 拒绝它；promise 落定时移除该效应","locale":"zh-CN"},"3139":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-17","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"`interval(cb, ms) → dispose`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3140":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-18","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"围绕 `setInterval` 的效应","locale":"zh-CN"},"3141":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-19","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"`interval(ms) → AsyncIterableIterator`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3142":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-20","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"每次 tick 只 resolve 最早的待处理 `next()`；没有等待者的 tick 被丢弃；具有异步迭代器的 `return()`/`throw()` 语义；释放纤程会拒绝待处理的读取","locale":"zh-CN"},"3143":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-21","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"`throttle(cb, ms, noTrailing?)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3144":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-22","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"前沿调用，除非 `noTrailing` 否则以最新参数做后沿调用；`.dispose()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3145":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-23","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"`debounce(cb, ms)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3146":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-24","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#timer","content":"每次调用重启定时器；`.dispose()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3147":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-25","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#logger-console","content":"`shared.ts`、`index.ts`、`browser.ts`。一个类插件（`name = 'logger-console'`），其构造函数调用 `ctx.logger.exporter(this)`，因此导出器的生存期与插件完全一致（见日志器）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3148":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-26","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#logger-console","content":"配置：`colors`（Node 下默认取自 `supports-color`）、`maxLength`、按名称的 `levels`、`showDiff`、`showTime` 模板、`label { width, margin, align }`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3149":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-27","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#logger-console","content":"它渲染 `[E]/[W]/[I]/[D]` 前缀、哈希着色的标签、对齐的续行以及可选的 `+Nms` 时间差；`%o` 使用 `util.inspect`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3150":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-28","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#logger-console","content":"浏览器构建委托给 `console.*`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3151":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-29","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#fs-node","content":"`index.ts`、`watcher.ts`。服务 `fs`，目前只有 `watch(path, { filter }) → Watcher`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3152":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-30","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#fs-node","content":"路径相对于**调用方的** `ctx.baseUrl` 解析；接受 `file:` URL；拒绝 Windows 的驱动器相对路径形式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3153":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-31","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#fs-node","content":"单个文件**通过其父目录**监听（`depth: 0`），因此基于重命名的原子写入不会丢失监听。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3154":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-32","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#fs-node","content":"`Watcher` 是一个包装 chokidar（`ignoreInitial`）的异步效应，在初始扫描之后注册。只转发 `change` 事件；`ready` 会异步地向后加入的监听器重放；分发使用快照；监听器错误交给 `error` 监听器（其自身的错误只被记录）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3155":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-33","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#fs-node","content":"过滤器由类 gitignore 的规则组成：**最后一个匹配胜出**，对条目*或其任一祖先*进行测试。若后面某条包含规则的字面基础路径与某目录相关，该目录仍会被遍历；离开根目录的模式会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3156":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-34","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"`index.ts`、`agent.ts`、`manifest.ts`、`backup.ts`、`process.ts`、`state.ts`。服务 `packageManager`：驱动 npm / pnpm / yarn classic / yarn berry 的事务式依赖安装（仅限提升式 `node_modules`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3157":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-35","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"`install(changes, { signal })` 串行执行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3158":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-36","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"从 `package.json#packageManager` 检测代理（精确版本，经 `--version` 验证），要求存在锁文件，并检查目录布局。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3159":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-37","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"对安装状态做快照，并备份清单、锁文件与 rc 文件（保留权限模式与符号链接）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3160":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-38","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"编辑 `package.json`（保留缩进、行尾与排序）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3161":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-39","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"以**无活动超时**和中止支持运行代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3162":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-40","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"对比安装状态（`added/removed/updated`，附真实路径）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3163":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-41","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"失败时：恢复文件并运行一次**不可取消的恢复安装**；若这也失败，则抛出 `AggregateError`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3164":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-42","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"进程在自己的进程组中启动（POSIX），并杀死整个进程树（SIGTERM → SIGKILL；Windows 上为 `taskkill /T`）。环境中会清除外层 `yarn run` 泄漏的变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3165":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-43","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#package-manager","content":"真实路径使用 Node 的 JS `realpath` 算法，以便与模块 URL 匹配（本意是为 hmr 提供根；仓库中尚未接通）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3166":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-44","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#loader-utils","content":"`index.ts`、`internal.ts`。`unwrapExports`（ESM/esbuild 互操作）以及 `ModuleLoader.fromInternal()`，后者提供对 Node 内部级联 ESM 加载器的访问（在 Node 22–24.12+ 之间按 API 是否存在来检测其形态）。纯粹的 Node 胶水代码；**没有 Rust 对应物**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3167":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-45","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"`create/src/index.ts`、`bin.ts`。一个独立的脚手架 CLI（不使用 core）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3168":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-46","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"提示输入名称并准备目录；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3169":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-47","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"从配置的 npm 注册表获取模板包（`@cordisjs/boilerplate`）的 tarball，并以 `strip: 1` 解压；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3170":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-48","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"可选地放置一个固定版本的 Yarn 二进制（五条成文规则）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3171":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-49","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"改写 `package.json`，可选地 `git init`，安装并启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3172":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-50","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#create","content":"错误时打印固定消息并 `process.exit(1)`（测试以子进程方式运行它）。`--mirror` 标志会被解析但未被使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3173":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-51","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#port","content":"timer、fs 与日志导出器都是薄包装，证明了 **“由效应决定生存期” + 调用方归属** 足以让任意资源变得可撤销：这正是论文 §6.1 中“在边界内获取资源”的模式（见讨论与相关工作）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3174":{"id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary-52","page_id":"/docs/reference-auxiliary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-auxiliary#port","content":"package-manager 与 create 是 Node 生态的工具；对 Rust 框架而言，它们是可选的，或必须重新定位目标（例如 Cargo / WASM 组件包）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3175":{"id":"/docs/reference-context","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"page","content":"上下文与反射","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","Cordis 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context","locale":"zh-CN"},"3176":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-0","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context","content":"Cordis 核心如何表示上下文、按领域存储服务绑定、通知依赖方，并通过 Proxy 解析余效应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3177":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-1","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#context","content":"`Context`：一等上下文","locale":"zh-CN"},"3178":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-2","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"构造","locale":"zh-CN"},"3179":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-3","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"用 `extend()` 派生","locale":"zh-CN"},"3180":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-4","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#realm-symbols","content":"领域符号","locale":"zh-CN"},"3181":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-5","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`ReflectService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3182":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-6","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#impl","content":"`Impl`：一个绑定","locale":"zh-CN"},"3183":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-7","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"`provide(name, value?, check?)`：余效应的提供","locale":"zh-CN"},"3184":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-8","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#set","content":"`set(name, value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3185":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-9","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#get","content":"`get(name, strict = true)` 与 `_getImpl`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3186":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-10","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#notify","content":"`notify(names, filter?)`：响应式通知","locale":"zh-CN"},"3187":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-11","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`accessor` 与 `mixin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3188":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-12","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"经由 Proxy 的属性访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"3189":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-13","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"`locate(ctx, name)`：已提交视图的遍历","locale":"zh-CN"},"3190":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-14","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"拦截","locale":"zh-CN"},"3191":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-15","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-context#design-observations","content":"设计观察","locale":"zh-CN"},"3192":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-16","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context","content":"本页介绍 `cordis/packages/core/src/context.ts`、`reflect.ts` 与 `utils.ts`。对应的论文内容是 §3.2（余效应（coeffect），见响应式余效应）、§5.1.2（算法 2–3）与 §5.1.4（算法 6），后两者见实现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3193":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-17","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#context","content":"`context.ts` 声明：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3194":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-18","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"`new Context()` 构建**根**上下文（`context.ts:36-49`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3195":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-19","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"创建空的 `isolate`/`intercept` 表（`Object.create(null)`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3196":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-20","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"用 `ReflectService.handler` 把自身包装进一个 `Proxy`。这个代理*就是*所有人看到的上下文；`this[symbols.root] = self`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3197":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-21","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"创建**根纤程（fiber）** `new Fiber(self, {}, {}, null, …)`（runtime 为 `null` ⇒ 根，uid 0，`ACTIVE`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3198":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-22","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"在根上实例化四个内置服务（service）：`reflect`、`registry`、`events`、`logger`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3199":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-23","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"调用 `this.fiber._disposables.clear()`。构造期间注册的内置 mixin 与访问器*不*属于根纤程的可撤销效应（revertible effect）：它们必须在 `root.fiber.dispose()` 之后依然存在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3200":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-24","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"`context.ts:55-63`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3201":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-25","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"每个派生上下文都是其父上下文的**原型链子对象**。这实现了论文中的*派生实现*（derived realization，定义 23）：子对象覆盖部分槽位，其余全部继承。无需撤销任何东西：丢弃子对象即丢弃了这次调整。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3202":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-26","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"`isolate(name, label?)`（`context.ts:65`）创建 `Object.create(this[symbols.isolate])`，设置 `shadow[name] = label ?? Symbol(name)` 并以此扩展。新符号给出私有领域（realm）；共享的 `label` 给出共享领域。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3203":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-27","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"`intercept(name, config)`（`context.ts:73`）以相同模式处理拦截（interception）表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3204":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-28","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"纤程的上下文是 `parent.extend({ fiber: this })`（`fiber.ts:150`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3205":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-29","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"**关键性质：** 隔离（isolation）表与拦截表都是*原型链*。查找（`table[name]`）看到最近的覆盖；`Object.hasOwn(table, name)` 检测恰好在这一层引入的隔离边界（`locate` 使用了这一点）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3206":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-30","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#realm-symbols","content":"`ReflectService.provide` 惰性地分配根领域：`ctx[symbols.root][symbols.isolate][name] ??= Symbol(name)`（`reflect.ts:222`）。因此，一旦被提供，*每个*服务名在根表中都有一个领域符号；被隔离的上下文会覆盖它。**存储以领域符号为键**，从而得到定义 24 的两层解析 `k → ρ(k) → σ(ρ(k))`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3207":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-31","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`reflect.ts` 持有共享的根级表：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3208":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-32","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3209":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-33","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"论文","locale":"zh-CN"},"3210":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-34","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3211":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-35","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`store: Dict<Impl, symbol>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3212":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-36","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"σ（`@@store`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3213":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-37","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"领域符号 → 当前 `Impl`（绑定）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3214":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-38","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`props: Dict<Property>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3215":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-39","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"–","locale":"zh-CN"},"3216":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-40","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"已声明的上下文属性：`{type:'service'}` 或 `{type:'accessor', get, set}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3217":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-41","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`_implCounter`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3218":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-42","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"新鲜名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"3219":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-43","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`Impl` 的 uid 来源（从不复用）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3220":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-44","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#impl","content":"`reflect.ts:65-75`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3221":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-45","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"`reflect.ts:213-249`。`provide` 是一个 `fiber.effect`（因此被追踪且可撤销），其回调：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3222":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-46","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"把 `props[name]` 注册或校验为服务（若已是访问器则报错）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3223":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-47","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"确保存在根领域符号，并计算 `key = ctx[isolate][name]`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3224":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-48","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"执行**单一来源检查**：若 `store[key]` 已存在，抛出 `service \"x\" has been registered at <fiber>`（O-Insert 的不相交性，按领域计）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3225":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-49","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"设置 `store[key] = impl` 与 `fiber.provisions.add(impl)`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3226":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-50","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"若提供者（provider）纤程已是 `ACTIVE`，立即调用 `notify([name])`；否则在该纤程变为 `ACTIVE` 时通知（`Fiber._updateState`），对应“只有 Active 纤程提供服务”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3227":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-51","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"它的**逆操作**是异步的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3228":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-52","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"删除存储条目（若仍指向此 impl），并 `notify` 该 impl 所在领域中的依赖方；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3229":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-53","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"**提供者侧守卫**：`await` 直到 `impl.dependents` 为空（`impl.release` 由最后一个依赖方的卸载来 resolve）。它总会至少让出一次，使子级清理仍能访问继承来的服务；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3230":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-54","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"从 `fiber.provisions` 中移除该 impl。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3231":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-55","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#set","content":"`reflect.ts:200-211`。原地覆盖*自己的*绑定（`impl.value = value`）；若该名称未被提供或由其他纤程提供则报错。**不发出通知**：正如论文所说，原地覆盖不会被依赖方观察到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3232":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-56","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#get","content":"`reflect.ts:188-198`。解析 `ctx[isolate][name]` → `store[key]`。在 `strict` 模式下，除非 `impl.ctx.fiber.state === ACTIVE`，否则什么也不返回（**提供者可用 = Active**）。它从不抛出异常。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3233":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-57","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#notify","content":"`reflect.ts:251-270`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3234":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-58","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#notify","content":"这就是算法 3。*filter* 参数的存在是为了让加载器（loader）在领域重新分配时替换领域判定（算法 7，见托管领域）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3235":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-59","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`accessor(name, {get, set})` 与 `mixin(source, keys)` 位于 `reflect.ts:272-308`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3236":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-60","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`accessor` 声明一个计算出的上下文属性（作为可撤销效应）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3237":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-61","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`mixin('events', ['on', 'emit', …])` 把某个服务的成员暴露为上下文属性（`ctx.on` → `ctx.events.on`），并绑定到发起访问的上下文。它是一个生成器效应，每个键产出一个访问器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3238":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-62","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"根上下文的接线（`reflect.ts:182-185`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3239":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-63","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"3240":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-64","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"混入上下文的键","locale":"zh-CN"},"3241":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-65","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`reflect`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3242":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-66","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`get`、`set`、`provide`、`accessor`、`mixin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3243":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-67","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`fiber`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3244":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-68","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`runtime`、`effect`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3245":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-69","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`registry`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3246":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-70","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`inject`、`plugin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3247":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-71","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`events`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3248":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-72","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`on`、`once`、`parallel`、`emit`、`serial`、`bail`、`waterfall`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3249":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-73","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"`ReflectService.handler`（`reflect.ts:105-170`）在其 `get` 陷阱中中介 `ctx.foo`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3250":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-74","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"*特殊*属性（符号、`prototype`、`then`、数字字符串、以 `_` 开头的名称）绕过中介；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3251":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-75","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"普通的自有或继承属性经 `getTraceable` 返回（见服务与可追溯性）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3252":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-76","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"已声明的**访问器** → 其 getter；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3253":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-77","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"若*定义点*（def site，即影子，见服务与可追溯性）是**根纤程** → 不加检查的 `reflect.get(prop, false)`（根代码无法声明 `inject`）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3254":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-78","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"否则在 `locate(defSite, prop)` 外包一层 `waterfall('internal/get', …)`（允许插件钩住访问）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3255":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-79","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"找到 impl → 其值（经追踪）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3256":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-80","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"纤程声明了该键但没有已提交的 impl → `cannot get required service \"x\" in inactive context`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3257":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-81","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"无人声明 → `cannot get property \"x\" without inject`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3258":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-82","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"`set` 陷阱：非根纤程上未声明的属性 → 错误 `cannot set property without provide`；访问器 → 其 setter；服务 → `waterfall('internal/set')` → `reflect.set`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3259":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-83","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"错误先以廉价占位符创建，只在被抛出时才以裁剪过的栈具体化（`createAccessError`/`enhanceAccessError`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3260":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-84","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"`reflect.ts:83-102` 实现算法 6，并扩展了自有提供与隔离边界：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3261":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-85","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"推论（均由 `tests/isolate.spec.ts` 与 `reflect.spec.ts` 覆盖）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3262":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-86","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"消费者（consumer）读取的是**已提交**的 impl，而非实时存储，因此在自身拆除期间仍能看到其依赖（定理 70）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3263":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-87","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"子插件*继承*祖先的依赖声明（在祖先上声明的 `inject` 允许后代访问）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3264":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-88","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"隔离边界会终止继承（`does not inherit the injected view across isolation boundaries`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3265":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-89","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"`Service[symbols.resolveIntercept]`（`service.ts:57-70`）在访问时解析名为 `name` 的服务的元数据：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3266":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-90","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"遍历上下文的拦截原型链，按**外 → 内**收集自有值；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3267":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-91","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"以最低优先级前置*组件（component）声明*的元数据 `locate(caller, name).fiber.inject[name]`（声明方纤程在 `inject: { name: meta }` 中给出的值）。自有提供没有这一项，且遍历在隔离边界处停止；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3268":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-92","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"用 `service[symbols.mergeIntercept]` 合并（默认 `Object.assign({}, ...values)`，即右侧优先）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3269":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-93","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"这正是定义 27 中的 `σ(k)(d(k) ⊕ ι(k))`，其中 ⊕ = 浅层对象合并（每个服务可自定义）。`logger` 服务用它处理 `{ name, level }`（`logger.ts:213-224`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3270":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-94","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#design-observations","content":"**一切都在根上。** 每个根只有一个 `store`、一个 `props` 和一个 `registry`；派生上下文之间的区别只在于原型链上的 `isolate`/`intercept` 表及其 `fiber`。这让“键 k 是否在领域 r 中被提供？”保持为一次映射查找。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3271":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-95","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#design-observations","content":"**提供者身份**是 `Impl.uid`，一个新鲜的计数器值。它实现了已提交视图与目标视图中“看名称而非值”的原则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3272":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-96","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#design-observations","content":"**按领域符号隔离**实现了放宽后的演算规则“在领域内不相交”（§4.4，见元理论）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3273":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-97","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#design-observations","content":"**没有编译期检查**：声明的键与访问的键只在运行时由代理检查（论文 §5.1.4 指出这本可以静态完成）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3274":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","type":"page","content":"效应","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","Cordis 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-effects","locale":"zh-CN"},"3275":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-0","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects","content":"Cordis 核心如何追踪可撤销效应：可接受的形态、执行引擎、fiber.effect、所有权转移与拆除顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3276":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-1","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-effects#shapes","content":"可接受的效应形态","locale":"zh-CN"},"3277":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-2","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-effects#execute","content":"引擎 `_execute(runner)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3278":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-3","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"`fiber.effect(execute, labe