('Invalid effect')`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3300":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-25","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#execute","content":"`fiber.ts:240-290`。`EffectRunner { epoch, execute, collect, getOuterStack }` 抽象了引擎的两个使用者：单次 `ctx.effect` 调用，以及纤程（fiber）的整个 `apply`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3301":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-26","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#execute","content":"`execute()` 产生效应值；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3302":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-27","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#execute","content":"`collect(dispose)` 记录一个被产出的逆操作；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3303":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-28","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#execute","content":"`epoch` 是**守卫**。对于异步迭代器，循环条件是 `while (runner.epoch === oldEpoch)`；纪元（epoch）改变时，循环在当前迭代落地后停止，并调用 `iter.return()` 以便生成器的 `finally` 块得以运行（`fiber.ts:269-285`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3304":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-29","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#execute","content":"**同步迭代器不可中断**（没有守卫检查）；在单线程宿主中它们本来也无法被中断。每次 `collect` 都会做类型检查（`safeCollect`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3305":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-30","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#execute","content":"`composeError(…, getOuterStack)` 把错误栈与效应或插件*创建*处捕获的栈（`buildOuterStack`）拼接起来，生成指向用户 `ctx.plugin(...)`/`ctx.effect(...)` 调用点的长栈追踪。这纯粹是开发体验上的处理，且是 JS 特有的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3306":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-31","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"`fiber.ts:292-357`。`ctx.effect` 就是 `ctx.fiber.effect`（由 `ReflectService` 混入）。逐步说明：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3307":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-32","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"`assertActive()`：`uid` 为 `null`（已移除）的纤程不能创建效应（`CordisError('INACTIVE_EFFECT')`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3308":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-33","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"一个局部列表 `disposables` 和一个局部 `dispose()`，后者**按逆序**运行它们。若其中一个返回 promise，其余的会串接在它之后（顺序 LIFO，`fiber.ts:298-311`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3309":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-34","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"用于内省的 `EffectMeta { label, children }`（`fiber.getEffects()`，供工具使用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3310":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-35","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"一个 runner，其 `epoch` 是布尔值（算法 1 中的 `armed`），其 `collect`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3311":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-36","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"把撤销函数推入局部列表，","locale":"zh-CN"},"3312":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-37","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"**将其从纤程的顶层列表中移除**（`this._disposables.delete(dispose)`），即所有权转移（见下文），","locale":"zh-CN"},"3313":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-38","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"记录子级元数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3314":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-39","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"执行。若同步抛出，释放（dispose）已收集的部分并重新抛出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3315":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-40","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"异步失败：`task.catch(dispose)`。失败的异步效应会回滚它已收集的部分，错误被记录到日志，而不是作为未处理的拒绝留下。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3316":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-41","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"构建返回的**包装器**（即撤销函数）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3317":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-42","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"至多一次（`epoch` 翻转为 `false`），即定理 7 的可靠性不变式；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3318":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-43","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"翻转 `epoch` 也会让进行中的异步迭代器在下一个边界处停止；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3319":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-44","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"若初始化仍在运行，释放会先等待它完成（`task.then(dispose)`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3320":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-45","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"`wrapper.then(...)` 使撤销函数**可被 await**：`await ctx.effect(...)` 等待初始化完成，并 resolve 为一个撤销函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3321":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-46","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"`disposables.push(this._disposables.push(wrapper))`：包装器被注册到**纤程的**列表中，而把它从该列表移除的函数是第一个局部撤销函数（因此手动释放一个效应也会把它从纤程中注销）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3322":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-47","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#ownership","content":"在另一个效应的回调中调用 `ctx.effect`，会先把内层包装器注册到纤程的列表中。若外层回调**产出或返回**该包装器，`collect` 会转移所有权：包装器离开纤程的列表，成为外层效应的一部分。若它未被产出，则仍是纤程的直接子项。这在*不*嵌套效应作用域的前提下实现了论文的“父级组合”（`ctx.dispose ← dispose ∘ ctx.dispose`）：纤程的累加器就是 `DisposableList` `fiber._disposables`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3323":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-48","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#disposable-list","content":"`utils.ts:5-40`。一个保持插入顺序的 `Map<number, T>` 加上一个 `WeakMap<T, number>`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3324":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-49","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#disposable-list","content":"`push(v)` 返回一个移除函数 `() => map.delete(sn)`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3325":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-50","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#disposable-list","content":"`delete(v)` 按身份移除；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3326":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-51","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#disposable-list","content":"`clear()` 以**逆序**（LIFO）返回所有值并清空列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3327":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-52","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#disposable-list","content":"它用于纤程的撤销函数、runtime 的纤程列表以及每个纤程的钩子列表。它是论文 §3.4.2 中“以新鲜 id 插入、按 id 移除”的可交换键设计的一个实例（见上下文范式）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3328":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-53","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#accumulator","content":"纤程的累加器不是一个组合好的闭包，而是列表 `fiber._disposables`。卸载时（`fiber.ts:488-498`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3329":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-54","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#accumulator","content":"撤销函数**按逆序发起，但并发运行**；每个都在一个微任务之后开始。在单个效应内部，它们是顺序 LIFO 的。论文承认了这一点（“`fiber.dispose` initiates a fiber's effects concurrently”，§5.1.3），并且在独立性结果下这是可靠的（定理 43：独立效应的逆操作可以按任意顺序运行；见元理论）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3330":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-55","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#accumulator","content":"因此，*同一个*逻辑效应内部的有序拆除，必须通过把它们组合进同一个 `ctx.effect`（生成器）来表达。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3331":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-56","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects#errors","content":"情形","locale":"zh-CN"},"3332":{"id":"/docs/referen