gins","content":"`apply` 的*返回值*被当作一个效应（见效应）：一个函数、一个 promise，或产出撤销函数的（异步）生成器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3455":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-22","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#plugins","content":"`RegistryService` 维护一个 `Map<callback, Plugin.Runtime>`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3456":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-23","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#plugins","content":"一个 runtime 汇集同一插件的所有纤程（fiber）；当其最后一个纤程被移除时，runtime 被注销（`fiber.ts:191-193`）。`registry.counter` 提供**纤程 uid**（`++counter`，从不复用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3457":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-24","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#ctx-plugin","content":"`registry.ts:231-245`。它解析别名（见 `replace`），在调用方纤程上调用 `assertActive()`，获取或创建 runtime，构造 `new Fiber(ctx, config, Inject.resolve(plugin.inject), runtime, outerStack)`，并返回一个以该纤程为原型、且**可 then** 的对象（`await ctx.plugin(...)` ≡ `fiber.await()`）。`ctx.inject(deps, cb)` 是 `ctx.plugin({ inject: deps, apply: cb })` 的语法糖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3458":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-25","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#replace","content":"`registry.ts:185-209`。**原地**替换现有纤程背后的实现：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3459":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-26","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#replace","content":"记录别名 `old → new`，此后 `ctx.plugin(old)` 会实例化 `new`（别名可链式跟随，也可以切换回来）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3460":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-27","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#replace","content":"通过 `fiber._replace(runtime, inject)` 把旧 runtime 的每个纤程移到新 runtime。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3461":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-28","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#replace","content":"`_replace`（`fiber.ts:401-416`）按新的 `inject` 重新检查依赖，清除 `_error`，递增 `_revisio