],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#fiber-state","content":"`LOADING`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3528":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-95","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#fiber-state","content":"`Reloading`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3529":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-96","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#fiber-state","content":"`ACTIVE`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3530":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-97","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#fiber-state","content":"`Active`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3531":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-98","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#fiber-state","content":"`UNLOADING`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3532":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-99","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#fiber-state","content":"`Unloading`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3533":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-100","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#fiber-state","content":"`FAILED`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3534":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-101","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#fiber-state","content":"`Inactive` + 错误结果（§4.4 Failure）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3535":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-102","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#fiber-state","content":"`DISPOSED`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3536":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-103","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#fiber-state","content":"已从注册表中移除（uid 为 `null`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3537":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-104","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#fiber-state","content":"`_getState()` 推导稳定状态：`uid === null → DISPOSED`，`_error → FAILED`，`epoch !== INACTIVE → ACTIVE`，否则 `PENDING`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3538":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-105","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#instantiation","content":"`fiber.ts:148-206`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3539":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-106","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#instantiation","content":"因此，子纤程恰好就是定义 52：父级的一个普通效应，其逆操作使子纤程退役。卸载父级会经由父级的累加器级联到子级。与演算不同，退役与移除被融合在一起：逆操作先退役，等待转换链结束，然后纤程即消失（其 uid 已为 `null`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3540":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-107","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#target","content":"`fiber.ts:387-429`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3541":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-108","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#target","content":"纪元（epoch）字符串就是论文中 `target(γ, n)` 的哈希，外加修订计数器（配置修订是一个新的效应函数，§4.4 Configuration；见元理论）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3542":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-109","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#state-machine","content":"`fiber.ts:431-514`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3543":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-110","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#set-epoch","content":"算法 5 的 `refresh`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3544":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-111","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#set-epoch","content":"在 `ACTIVE` 状态下，从一个非 ⊥ 目标变为另一个非 ⊥ 目标，会先经过 `UNLOADING`，再串接进入 `LOADING`（卸载在结束时检查纪元）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3545":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-112","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#reload","content":"**惯性（inertia）：** 过时的目标不会中止进行中的 `apply`。加载照常落地，纤程随后再卸载（异步宿主采取 L-Divert 中*落地*的那个分支）。执行前让出的那个微任务，使一连串 `update()` 调用能完全跳过被取代的加载（`update.spec.ts: 'skips superseded loads before executing the plugin'`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3546":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-113","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#update-state","content":"`fiber.ts:372-385`。它设置新状态，发出 `internal/status(fiber, oldState)`，并且**只在进入或离开 `ACTIVE` 的转换上**，通知仍绑定在存储中的每个提供项的依赖方（`ctx.isolate(name, impl.isolate).reflect.notify([name])`）。因此，从 `ACTIVE` 进入 `UNLOADING` 会让所有消费者在任何逆操作被调度*之前*重新计算出一个未满足的目标（L-Leave），而此时绑定在物理上仍然存在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3547":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-114","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#guards","content":"**纤程级**（`_unload` 中的循环）：只要还有任何提供项有依赖方，提供者纤程就不运行*任何*撤销函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3548":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-115","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#guards","content":"**绑定级**（`provide` 的逆操作，见 `provide`）：撤回一个绑定只等待该绑定的依赖方。这使一个提供者可以撤回绑定 A 而无需等待绑定 B 的消费者（`service-dispose.spec.ts: 'withdraws one binding without waiting for another binding from the same provider'`），也使一个绑定可以在某个消费者初始化期间被替换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3549":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-116","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#guards","content":"依赖方以 `Impl.dependents: Set<Fiber>` 追踪（在提交时填充，在依赖方卸载结束时清除），这是 `relied_n` 在运行时（runtime）中的形式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3550":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-117","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#await-update-restart","content":"`fiber.ts:516-552`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3551":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-118","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#await-update-restart","content":"`await()` 在 `inertia` 上循环直到稳定；若纤程为 `FAILED`，则抛出 `_error`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3552":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-119","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#await-update-restart","content":"`restart()`（在 `ctx.fiber` 上）：`_revision++`、`_refresh()`、await。对根纤程而言，`dispose()` *就是* `restart()`：一切都被卸载，然后根重新变为活跃。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3553":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-120","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#await-update-restart","content":"`update(config, noSave = false)` 是配置修订路径：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3554":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-121","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#await-update-restart","content":"若已加载，解析并校验新配置（`internal/config` waterfall → Standard Schema `validate`，仅同步；`ValidationError` 保留问题路径）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3555":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-122","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#await-update-restart","content":"除非 `noSave`，否则 `emit('internal/commit', fiber, config)`（加载器把配置写回其条目）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3556":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-123","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#await-update-restart","content":"保存配置并清除 `_error`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3557":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-124","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#await-update-restart","content":"若已加载，执行 `waterfall(fiber, 'internal/update', resolved, restart)`：每个纤程的 `internal/update` 监听器（由插件通过 `ctx.on('internal/update', …)` 注册）可以通过不调用 `next()` 来**不重启**地接受新配置；否则执行 `restart()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3558":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-125","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#await-update-restart","content":"返回的 promise 被标记为已处理，因此被丢弃的结果不会引发未处理的拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3559":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-126","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#await-update-restart","content":"`tests/update.spec.ts` 验证的并发语义：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3560":{"id":"/docs/reference-fibers-127","page_id":"/docs/reference-fibers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-fibers#await-update-restart","content":"并发更新最终落定在最新