-loader-121","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#init","content":"`rebuild.spec.ts` / `evaluate.spec.ts` 覆盖了导入期间重命名、释放期间移除、插件重命名自己的条目等情形。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3878":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-122","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#entry-tree","content":"`config/tree.ts:71-261` 与 `config/group.ts`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3879":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-123","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#entry-tree","content":"`EntryTree`：`ctx`、`root: EntryGroup`、按本地 id 的 `store: Dict<Entry>`；`create/remove/update(id, options, parent?, position?)`（运行时 API，在提交任何东西之前做深度校验；支持树内与跨树移动）、`resolve(compositeId)`、`getTasks()/await()`、抽象的 `commit(change)`。`EntryChange { id, group, from?, options?, legacy? }` 编码 create / remove / update / move。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3880":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-124","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#entry-tree","content":"`EntryGroup.update(config)` 是**按键协调**：取新旧 id 的并集；对每个 id 并行（`Promise.all`）执行 `create()`（采用/更新，强制）或 `remove()`。匿名条目获得唯一键，因此每个都以新的随机 id 创建。一个坏条目不会阻止其他条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3881":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-125","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#entry-tree","content":"`Group`（即 `@cordisjs/plugin-group` 插件）继承 `EntryGroup`，**共享父树的存储**，并通过 `ctx.on('internal/update', config => this.update(config))` 否决重启。这就是论文中的“分组协调与条目更新沿树一同递归”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3882":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-126","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#entry-tree","content":"`remove`/`_reject` 中“先注销、后释放”的顺序，使自我释放检测能够区分加载器驱动的释放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3883":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-127","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#module-import","content":"`config/tree.ts:198-246` 与 `resolve.ts`。模块经由 Node 的内部 ESM 加载器（通过 `loader-utils`）导入，以树的 `baseUrl` 作为父 URL，因此说明符相对于配置文件解析。裸说明符经由生成的辅助模块 `<scope>/.cordis/resolve.mjs` 解析，因此会在*项目的*依赖图中解析。所请求模块的 `ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND` 会变成定位到条目 `name` 的 `ModuleNotFoundError`；缺失的*传递*依赖则仍是插件自身的错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3884":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-128","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"`config/isolate.ts`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3885":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-129","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"`isolate: { svc: true }` → 由条目拥有的 **LocalRealm**（符号 `svc#<localId>`），随条目一起移动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3886":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-130","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"`isolate: { svc: 'label' }` → 由所有使用该标签的条目共享的 **GlobalRealm**（符号 `svc@label`）；当不再有条目引用它时，在 `loader/partial-dispose` 上被回收。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3887":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-131","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"每个条目在 `loader/entry-init` 时获得自己的隔离表（`Object.create(parent table)`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3888":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-132","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"`loader/patch-context` 监听器实现了算法 7：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3889":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-133","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"计算新表（自有键来自 `options.isolate`，继承父分组的表）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3890":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-134","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"对每个领域符号发生变化的名称，打上新的**分隔标签** `entry.ctx[delim(name)]`（它标记“此条目内部的上下文”，被后代继承），并为存储中找到的提供者记录 `[oldSym, newSym, entryTag, providerTag]`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3891":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-135","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"**原地**重新挂接并替换表（为后代保持身份）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3892":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-136","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"运行补丁的其余部分（`next()`）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3893":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-137","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"若提供者位于条目内部（标签相等）且新符号空闲，则把该绑定**迁移**到新符号。提供者保留同一个 `Impl`（同一个 uid），并且**不重启**。若目标已被占用，迁移被*阻止*，`Impl.isolate` 继续追踪绑定的真实位置；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3894":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-138","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"以过滤器 `ctx.isolate[name] ∈ {old, new} && (entryTag === ctx[delim]) !== (entryTag === providerTag)` 调用 `reflect.notify(names, filter)`：只有内外关系与提供者不同的纤程才会被重新检查；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3895":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-139","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"去掉条目自身不需要的分隔标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3896":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-140","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#managed-realms","content":"**可能的缺陷（已在源码中核实）：** 在领域回收监听器中（`config/isolate.ts:150-153`），当某个条目仍引用该领域时，内层循环使用了 `return`。这会退出整个监听器，跳过同一 `legacy.isolate` 中其余名称的回收；本意几乎可以肯定是（外层循环的）`continue`。后果：一个过时的全局领域可能一直存活到之后的某次 partial-dispose。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3897":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-141","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#validation","content":"`config/utils.ts:159-209`。`validateOptions(options, sep, deep)` 返回 `Issue { message, path }[]`，检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3898":{"id":"/docs/reference-loader-142","page_id":"/docs/reference-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-loader#validation","conten