fiber, so a listener is removed when its plugin unloads. All return `Result<EffectHandle>`.","locale":"en"},"7060":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-services-172","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-services#listening","content":"Method","locale":"en"},"7061":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-services-173","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-services#listening","content":"Registers","locale":"en"},"7062":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-services-174","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-services#listening","content":"`ctx.on(f)`","locale":"en"},"7063":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-services-175","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-services#listening","content":"a synchronous listener, after those registered so far","locale":"en"},"7064":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-services-176","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-services#listening","content":"`ctx.on_prepend(f)`","locale":"en"},"7065":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-services-177","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-services#listening","content":"a synchronous listener, before those registered so far","locale":"en"},"7066":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-services-178","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-services#listening","content":"`ctx.on_async(f)`","locale":"en"},"7067":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-services-179","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-services#listening","content":"an asynchronous listener (returns a future)","locale":"en"},"7068":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-services-180","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-services#listening","content":"`ctx.once(f)`","locale":"en"},"7069":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-services-181","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"