ctors, because instances may be proxies.","locale":"en"},"8340":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-26","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"Any object with a `[symbols.tracker]` descriptor `{ property?: 'ctx', associate?: string, noShadow?: boolean }` is wrapped by `getTraceable(ctx, value)` whenever it is read off a context. `createTraceable` (`utils.ts:164-220`) returns a Proxy that behaves as follows:","locale":"en"},"8341":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-27","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"Access","locale":"en"},"8342":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-28","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"Result","locale":"en"},"8343":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-29","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"`value[tracker.property]` (i.e. `service.ctx`)","locale":"en"},"8344":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-30","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"the **use-site** context","locale":"en"},"8345":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-31","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"`value[symbols.caller]`","locale":"en"},"8346":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-32","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"the def site (the caller's def site)","locale":"en"},"8347":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-33","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"`value[symbols.original]`","locale":"en"},"8348":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-34","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"the raw object","locale":"en"},"8349":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-35","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"`value.foo` where `\"${associate}.foo\"` is a declared context property","locale":"en"},"8350":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-36","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"the associated property (e.g. service `foo.bar` reachable as `ctx.foo.bar`; mixins into associated types such as sessions)","locale":"en"},"8351":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-37","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"a getter / method","locale":"en"},"8352":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-38","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"invoked with a **shadow receiver** whose `ctx` is `useSite.extend({ [symbols.shadow]: defSite })`","locale":"en"},"8353":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-39","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"a nested traceable value","locale":"en"},"8354":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-40","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"traced again with the use site","locale":"en"},"8355":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-services-41","page_id":"/en/docs/reference-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/reference-services#traceable-proxies","content":"calling a callable service","locale":"en"},"8356":{"id":"/en/docs/reference-serv