2580,"`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)`"],[6060,"`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)`"],[6841,"`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)`"],[5212,"`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)`, `ctx.plugin_value::<P>(value)`, `ctx.plugin_def(&def, value)` and `ctx.inject(inject, f)` return `kardia_core::Result<Fiber>`; the closure of `inject` is `Fn(Context) -> Fut`. `ctx.plugin::<P>(config)` requires `P::Config: Serialize`: the typed config is serialized to a `Value` and decoded like any other configuration, so a `Deserialize`-only config is passed as JSON with `plugin_value`."],[951,"`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)`、`ctx.plugin_value::<P>(value)`、`ctx.plugin_def(&def, value)` 和 `ctx.inject(inject, f)` 返回 `kardia_core::Result<Fiber>`；`inject` 的闭包是 `Fn(Context) -> Fut`。`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)` 要求 `P::Config: Serialize`：带类型的配置会被序列化为 `Value`，然后像其他任何配置一样解码，因此只实现了 `Deserialize` 的配置要通过 `plugin_value` 以 JSON 传入。"],[5228,"`ctx.plugin(..)` creates `FiberData` (fresh `FiberId`, child `Scope`), resolves injections, and registers on the **parent** fiber an effect whose body inserts the fiber into its runtime and runs `refresh`, and whose inverse marks it removed, forces the target to ⊥, awaits the transition chain and settles to `Disposed` (TS `fiber.ts:178-206`). Unloading a parent therefore cascades to children through the parent's accumulator; re-enabling creates a *fresh* fiber (paper §4.4, Configuration)."],[967,"`ctx.plugin(..)` 创建 `FiberData`（新的 `FiberId`、子 `Scope`），解析依赖声明，并在**父**纤程上注册一个效应：其效应体把纤程插入它的运行时并运行 `refresh`，其逆操作把它标记为已移除、把目标强制设为 ⊥、等待转换链完成并最终落定为 `Disposed`（TS `fiber.ts:178-206`）。因此，卸载父纤程会通过父纤程的累积器级联到子纤程；重新启用会创建一个*全新的*纤程（论文 §4.4，Configuration）。"],[5701,"`ctx.plugin()` / its effect's inverse"],[1440,"`ctx.plugin()` / 其效应的逆操作"],[3435,"`ctx.plugin(plugin, config)`"],[7696,"`ctx.plugin(plugin, config)`"],[2660,"`ctx.provide_arc_as(key, arc)`"],[6921,"`ctx.provide_arc_as(key, arc)`"],[2507,"`ctx.provide_arc(arc)`"],[2656,"`ctx.provide_arc(arc)`"],[6768,"`ctx.provide_arc(arc)`"],[6917,"`ctx.provide_arc(arc)`"],[2509,"`ctx.provide